url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#resource-requirements","content":"Based on this reference, you can extrapolate other hardware resource requirements from one resource value.\nFor example, if you have 2 SSD disks, you would need 4 CPU cores, 8GB memory, and 20Gbps bandwidth. 4GB memory is also acceptable, depending on business concurrency - if concurrency is not high, memory doesn't need to be increased.","locale":"en"},"1575":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-18","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#resource-requirements","content":"This is for reference only. Actual requirements depend on your specific business needs.","locale":"en"},"1576":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-19","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#create-installation-package","content":"Compile and package the software. For compilation steps, see Download and Compile Curvine.","locale":"en"},"1577":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-20","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#create-installation-package","content":"From the project root, run:","locale":"en"},"1578":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-21","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#create-installation-package","content":"This runs `make all` (if needed), then packages the contents of `build/dist` into a tar.gz file. The archi