et","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","content":"The official StatefulSet example is `curvine-csi/examples/statefulset-curvine.yaml` in the Curvine source tree.","locale":"en"},"2578":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-7","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","content":"Use this pattern when each replica needs its own persistent directory instead of sharing one PVC.","locale":"en"},"2579":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-8","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#example-resources","content":"The example creates:","locale":"en"},"2580":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-9","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#example-resources","content":"`Service/curvine-service`","locale":"en"},"2581":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-10","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#example-resources","content":"`StatefulSet/curvine-statefulset`","locale":"en"},"2582":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-11","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#example-resources","content":"namespace `curvine`","locale":"en"},"2583":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-12","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#example-resources","content":"`3` replicas","locale":"en"},"2584":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-13","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulS