S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-20","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#what-happens","content":"Because each PVC is distinct, each pod gets independent application data even though all of them use the same CSI driver and `StorageClass`.","locale":"en"},"2592":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-21","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#verify-pvc-separation","content":"Check the rendered content inside each replica:","locale":"en"},"2593":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-22","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#verify-pvc-separation","content":"The output should differ by pod hostname and PVC name.","locale":"en"},"2594":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-23","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#check-persistence","content":"If `retained` is still present after the pod is recreated, the StatefulSet is correctly reusing the original PVC.","locale":"en"},"2595":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-24","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#notes","content":"The example uses `ReadWriteOnce` in `volumeClaimTemplates`, which matches the common StatefulSet pattern of one writer per replica.","locale":"en"},"2596":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-25","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#notes","content":"The dynamically created Curvine directory is still derived from the StorageClass `fs-path` plus the generated PV