r more workers to the decommission list. |","locale":"en","table":"table-2"},"2968":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-52","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node-worker-management","content":"| Option                             | Description                                            |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `--remove-decommission <NODES>...` | Remove one or more workers from the decommission list. |","locale":"en","table":"table-2"},"2969":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-53","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node-worker-management","content":"`<NODES>` supports two forms:","locale":"en"},"2970":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-54","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node-worker-management","content":"Space-separated arguments: `host1:8997 host2:8997`","locale":"en"},"2971":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-55","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node-worker-management","content":"A single comma-separated argument: `host1:8997,host2:8997`","locale":"en"},"2972":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-56","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node-worker-management","content":"Examples:","locale":"en"},"2973":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-57","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node-worker-management","content":"`cv node --versions` prints the release-version distribution across live\nworkers, preferring the structured `component_info.release_version` reported on\nheartbeat and falling back to 