mount-mount-ufs-into-curvine","content":"| Option                | Description                                                  |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `--ttl-ms <DURATION>` | TTL, default `7d`. Supports durations such as `1h` and `7d`. |","locale":"en","table":"table-6"},"3020":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-104","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount-mount-ufs-into-curvine","content":"| Option           | Description             |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `--replicas <N>` | Override replica count. |","locale":"en","table":"table-6"},"3021":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-105","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount-mount-ufs-into-curvine","content":"| Option                | Description                               |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `--block-size <SIZE>` | Override block size, for example `128MB`. |","locale":"en","table":"table-6"},"3022":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-106","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount-mount-ufs-into-curvine","content":"| Option                      | Description            |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `-s, --storage-type <TYPE>` | Override storage type. |","locale":"en","table":"table-6"},"3023":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-107","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount-mount-ufs-into-curvine","content":"| Option                               | Description                                                               |\n| ------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------