class 还定义了 `executionEntries.ReportSummary`。Fluid 会在 master Pod 中调用这个入口，把缓存状态刷新到 Dataset Status。Curvine 镜像中的脚本路径是：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3656":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-66","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"该脚本会执行：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3657":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-67","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"它只向 stdout 输出严格 JSON，格式遵循 Fluid 的 ReportSummary 输出要求：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3658":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-68","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"Curvine 只上报 master 能低成本返回的值：已缓存字节数、缓存容量和文件数。`ufsTotal`、`cachedPercentage`、`cacheHitRatio` 暂时保持为 `0`，直到 Curvine 有权威的 UFS 总量和命中率元数据。这样可以避免把“缓存容量使用率”误写成“Dataset 缓存百分比”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3659":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"从这个文件开始：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3660":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"应用：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3661":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"示例文件同时包含两个资源：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3662":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type"