-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdk-ffi-层","content":"SPDK FFI 层","locale":"zh-cn"},"3900":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkpoller专用-io-线程","content":"SpdkPoller（专用 I/O 线程）","locale":"zh-cn"},"3901":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#io-请求协议","content":"I/O 请求协议","locale":"zh-cn"},"3902":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkbdev块设备句柄","content":"SpdkBdev（块设备句柄）","locale":"zh-cn"},"3903":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#nvme-queue-pairqpair","content":"NVMe Queue Pair（Qpair）","locale":"zh-cn"},"3904":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#qpair-pool","content":"Qpair Pool","locale":"zh-cn"},"3905":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkiochannel","content":"SpdkIoChannel","locale":"zh-cn"},"3906":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#dmabufdma-缓冲区","content":"DmaBuf（DMA 缓冲区）","locale":"zh-cn"},"3907":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#bdevoffsetallocator","content":"BdevOffsetAllocator","locale":"zh-cn"},"3908":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkmetastore","content":"SpdkMetaStore","locale":"zh-cn"},"3909":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#读路径","content":"读路径","locale":"zh-cn"},"3910":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#写路径","content":"写路径","locale":"zh-cn"},"3911":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#block-生命周期","content":"Block 生命周期","locale":"zh-cn"},"3912":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#dma-缓冲区管理","content":"DMA 缓冲区管理","locale":"zh-cn"},"3913":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#对齐约束","content":"对齐约束","locale":"zh-cn"},"3914":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#配置","content":"配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"3915":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#快速开始","content":"快速开始","locale":"zh-cn"},"3916":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#优化实验下一步","content":"优化实验：下一步","locale":"zh-cn"},"3917":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#代码参考","content":"代码参考","locale":"zh-cn"},"3918":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#概述","content":"SPDK（Storage Performance Development Kit）让 Curvine 能够绕过内核，在用户态执行 NVMe I/O。Worker 不再通过内核 VFS（`pread`/`pwrite`）读写数据，而是通过 TCP 或 RDMA 直接访问 NVMe-oF target，并配合专用 poller 线程和基于 hugepage 的 DMA 缓冲区，将延迟降到最低。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3919":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#概述","content":"Curvine 将 SPDK 作为一种**远程块设备**使用。NVMe-oF target 可以是同一主机上的物理 NVMe 盘、专用的 SPDK target 容器，也可以是远程存储节点。Worker 会打开 `SpdkBdev` 句柄（类似 `LocalFile`），并通过 `BlockIO` trait 发起读写 I/O。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3920":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#什么时候使用-spdk","content":"SPDK 原生可以在单核上达到超过 1000 万 IOPS[1]。Curvine 的 SPDK 路径面向内核 VFS 开销成为瓶颈的工作负载。当你需要比 LocalFile 更低的延迟或更高的吞吐时，就适合启用 SPDK。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3921":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkenv全局环境","content":"`orpc/src/io/spdk_env.rs`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3922":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkenv全局环境","content":"`SpdkEnv` 是初始化 SPDK 应用框架的单例，负责 DPDK EAL、hugepage 和 reactor mask 等全局资源。启动时它会执行以下操作：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3923":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkenv全局环境","content":"为 DMA 缓冲区分配 hugepage","locale":"zh-cn"},"3924":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkenv全局环境","content":"通过 `reactor_mask` 设置 CPU 亲和性","locale":"zh-cn"},"3925":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkenv全局环境","content":"发现 NVMe-oF target 及其 namespace","locale":"zh-cn"},"3926":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkenv全局环境","content":"创建 `SpdkPoller` 线程","locale":"zh-cn"},"3927":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkenv全局环境","content":"为每个 controller 维护 qpair 池","locale":"zh-cn"},"3928":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkenv全局环境","content":"每个 Worker 进程只会存在一个 `SpdkEnv`，并从 `SpdkConf` 初始化。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3929":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkenvstate","content":"`orpc/src/io/spdk_env.rs`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3930":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkenvstate","content":"`SpdkEnvState` 是控制 `SpdkEnv` 初始化和关闭的三状态生命周期状态机：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3931":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkenvstate","content":"它以 `AtomicU8` 存储，支持无锁读取。该状态会限制句柄获取流程（`acquire_handle` 先增加计数，再校验状态为 `Initialized`），并通过 CAS 将 `Initialized → ShutDown`，防止并发关闭。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3932":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdk-ffi-层","content":"`orpc/src/io/spdk_ffi.rs`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3933":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdk-ffi-层","content":"Curvine 通过一层很薄的 FFI 与 SPDK C 库交互，从而将 Rust 代码与 SPDK 的 C ABI 隔离开。这里主要使用三种技术：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3934":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdk-ffi-层","content":"**不透明 ZST 指针**：`spdk_nvme_ctrlr` 等 SPDK 类型在 Rust 中声明为零大小 enum，仅用于编译期类型安全；运行时仍是直接传给 C 的原始指针。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3935":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdk-ffi-层","content":"**固定大小字节缓冲区**：SPDK C 结构体（异步上下文、namespace 数据等）用带有 `#[repr(C, align(8))]` 的 `[u8; N]` 表示，而不是逐字段复刻 C 布局。这样可以避免不同 SPDK 版本之间的结构体布局差异。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3936":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdk-ffi-层","content":"**`curvine_*` C 辅助函数**：用小型 C wrapper 在已知偏移处设置结构体字段。例如 Rust 调用 `curvine_spdk_async_ctx_init(...)`，而不是直接操作 C 结构体字段。初始化时会通过运行时 `sizeof()` 检查比较 Rust 缓冲区大小和真实 C 结构体大小，一旦 ABI 漂移就能立即发现。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3937":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkpoller专用-io-线程","content":"`orpc/src/io/spdk_poller.rs`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3938":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkpoller专用-io-线程","content":"SPDK 要求所有 NVMe 命令提交和完成处理都在持有 SPDK reactor 上下文的同一个线程上执行。`SpdkPoller` 用来连接发起 I/O 的异步 handler 线程和同步的 SPDK 轮询循环。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3939":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkpoller专用-io-线程","content":"**Idle**：poller 阻塞在 `eventfd` 上，避免空转消耗 CPU。handler 线程在入队新请求时会通知 `eventfd`，将 poller 唤醒到 Active 状态。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3940":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkpoller专用-io-线程","content":"**Active**：从请求 channel 中取出待处理请求，通过 `spdk_nvme_ns_cmd_read`/`write` 提交 NVMe 命令，轮询 qpair 完成队列，并调用每个 I/O 的回调。队列为空后，它会先自旋 `spin_iter` 次再切回 Idle。这种 **spin-before-park** 策略避免了下一个 I/O 紧接到来时产生一次 `eventfd` 唤醒往返，使 poller 保持在低开销轮询循环中，而不是频繁执行 park/unpark 系统调用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3941":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkpoller专用-io-线程","content":"**Orphaned（HashMap）**：当 `curvine_spdk_qpair_poll` 返回错误时，对应 qpair 会从 Active 转入 `orphaned` HashMap。poller 会通过 `force_complete_qpair` 强制完成该 qpair 上所有挂起 I/O，并用错误状态唤醒阻塞的 handler 线程。orphaned 记录会保留，用来接住后续迟到的 SPDK 回调。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3942":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#io-请求协议","content":"`orpc/src/io/spdk_poller.rs`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3943":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#io-请求协议","content":"handler 线程通过三种类型与 poller 通信：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3944":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-51","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#io-请求协议","content":"**IoOp**：操作枚举。`Read` 和 `Write` 携带 namespace、qpair、DMA buffer、offset 和 length；`Flush` 作用于 namespace；`UnregisterQpair` 用于通知清理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3945":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-52","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#io-请求协议","content":"**IoRequest**：封装 `IoOp`、`Arc<IoCompletion>` 以及每个 bdev 的 inflight 计数器，通过 crossbeam channel 发送。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3946":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-53","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#io-请求协议","content":"**IoCompletion**：连接 handler 和 poller 线程。handler 在 `wait(timeout)` 上阻塞；poller 的 C 回调通过 `complete(status)` 唤醒它。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3947":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-54","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkbdev块设备句柄","content":"`orpc/src/io/spdk_bdev.rs`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3948":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-55","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkbdev块设备句柄","content":"`SpdkBdev` 是每个 bdev 的句柄，类似 `LocalFile`。它持有：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3949":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-56","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkbdev块设备句柄","content":"原始 NVMe namespace 和 qpair 指针","locale":"zh-cn"},"3950":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-57","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkbdev块设备句柄","content":"DMA 读写缓冲区（基于 hugepage、固定大小，由 `dma_buf_size` 控制，默认 1 MB，并在 I/O 间复用）","locale":"zh-cn"},"3951":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-58","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkbdev块设备句柄","content":"发送到 poller 线程的 I/O channel","locale":"zh-cn"},"3952":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-59","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkbdev块设备句柄","content":"当前偏移（`pos`）、设备大小、block size","locale":"zh-cn"},"3953":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-60","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkbdev块设备句柄","content":"大 I/O 会被**分块**：拆成 `dma_buf_size` 大小的 chunk，并串行提交。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3954":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-61","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkbdev块设备句柄","content":"`BlockDevice`（位于 `orpc/src/io/block_io.rs`）将 `SpdkBdev` 和 `LocalFile` 包装到同一个 enum 中，并实现 `BlockIO`。handler 代码在运行时通过 trait 分发，不需要知道底层使用哪个 backend。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3955":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-62","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#nvme-queue-pairqpair","content":"`orpc/src/io/spdk_env.rs`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3956":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-63","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#nvme-queue-pairqpair","content":"NVMe I/O queue pair（qpair）是主机与 NVMe-oF target 之间的通信通道。命令（read/write/flush）提交到 submission queue（SQ），完成事件从 completion queue（CQ）返回。poller 会轮询 CQ 来发现已完成的 I/O。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3957":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-64","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#nvme-queue-pairqpair","content":"每个 `SpdkBdev` 都持有一个 qpair，并绑定到 target 的 namespace。qpair **不是线程安全的**，所有提交和轮询都必须在同一个线程上完成，这也是为什么需要一个专用 `SpdkPoller` 线程。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3958":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-65","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#qpair-pool","content":"`orpc/src/io/spdk_env.rs`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3959":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-66","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#qpair-pool","content":"分配和释放 qpair 需要通过 C FFI 调用 SPDK，而 SPDK 可能会进一步向 controller 发送 NVMe admin 命令。为了避免每次打开/关闭 bdev 都产生这类开销，`QpairPool` 会按 controller 缓存空闲 qpair：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3960":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-67","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#qpair-pool","content":"**Acquire**：弹出一个缓存 qpair（零 FFI）。如果池为空，则调用 `curvine_spdk_alloc_io_qpair` 分配新 qpair。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3961":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-68","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#qpair-pool","content":"**Release**：将 qpair 放回池中。如果池超过上限（默认每个 controller 16 个），则通过 `curvine_spdk_free_io_qpair` 释放多余 qpair，以限制 controller 侧内存占用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3962":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#qpair-pool","content":"**Drain**：关闭时，`drain_all()` 会释放所有缓存 qpair。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3963":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkiochannel","content":"`orpc/src/io/spdk_bdev.rs:27`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3964":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkiochannel","content":"`SpdkIoChannel` 是 `SpdkBdev` 和 `SpdkPoller` 之间的桥梁。每个 bdev 持有一个 channel，其中包含：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3965":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkiochannel","content":"**qpair**：用于发起命令的 NVMe queue pair","locale":"zh-cn"},"3966":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-73","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkiochannel","content":"**poller_tx**：用于向 poller 线程提交 `IoRequest` 的 crossbeam sender","locale":"zh-cn"},"3967":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-74","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkiochannel","content":"**eventfd**：用于从 Idle 状态唤醒 poller 的文件描述符","locale":"zh-cn"},"3968":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-75","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkiochannel","content":"**poller_is_sleeping**：由 poller 在 idle 时置为 true 的共享 `AtomicBool`；bdev 会检查它，从而跳过不必要的 eventfd write 系统调用","locale":"zh-cn"},"3969":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-76","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkiochannel","content":"`SpdkIoChannel` 不直接保存 `SpdkPoller` 引用，所有通信都通过 channel 和 eventfd 完成，因此 bdev 可以做到线程安全。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3970":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-77","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#dmabufdma-缓冲区","content":"`orpc/src/io/spdk_bdev.rs`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3971":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-78","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#dmabufdma-缓冲区","content":"`DmaBuf` 是一个预分配、固定大小、基于 hugepage 的 NVMe DMA 缓冲区。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3972":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-79","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#dmabufdma-缓冲区","content":"**Hugepage 支持**：通过 `curvine_spdk_dma_malloc` 分配，返回物理连续且固定的内存，满足 NVMe controller 的 DMA 要求，并减少大 I/O 中的 TLB miss。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3973":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-80","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#dmabufdma-缓冲区","content":"**预分配和复用**：每个 `SpdkBdev` 在打开时通过 `curvine_spdk_dma_malloc` 分配两个缓冲区（读 + 写），并在所有 I/O 中复用。这样避免了每次 I/O 都 malloc/free，首次分配之后使用成本很低。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3974":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-81","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#dmabufdma-缓冲区","content":"**关闭时清理**：在 `SpdkBdev::drop` 中通过 `curvine_spdk_dma_free` 释放缓冲区。如果 drop 截止时间前 inflight I/O 未清空，则将缓冲区指针置空，避免 use-after-free（以安全泄漏换取正确性）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3975":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-82","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#dmabufdma-缓冲区","content":"**通过分块复用**：大 I/O 会被拆成 `dma_buf_size` 大小的 chunk，并通过同一个固定缓冲区串行处理，不需要动态大小的 DMA 内存。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3976":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-83","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#dmabufdma-缓冲区","content":"**块对齐**：所有 offset 都会向下对齐到设备 block size。这是 NVMe 规范要求，未对齐 DMA 地址会导致 controller 错误。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3977":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-84","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#bdevoffsetallocator","content":"`curvine-server/src/worker/storage/dir_state.rs`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3978":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-85","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#bdevoffsetallocator","content":"使用 `LocalFile` 存储时，内核文件系统会为每个文件分配磁盘 block 并追踪空闲空间。使用 SPDK 时，多个 Curvine block 共享同一个原始 bdev，中间没有内核文件系统，NVMe 设备暴露的是扁平字节地址空间。`BdevOffsetAllocator` 用来替代内核 block allocator：它为每个 block 在 bdev 上分配唯一的字节范围，并在 block 删除时回收该范围。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3979":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-86","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#bdevoffsetallocator","content":"它通过 bump cursor 管理新分配，并通过 free-list 记录已回收范围，同时合并相邻范围来减少碎片。该分配器是线程安全的。Worker 重启后，会通过 `SpdkMetaStore` 从 RocksDB 快照恢复 cursor 位置和 free-list，确保不会重复分配。当前实现是直接的 bump-and-free-list 设计，后续仍需要继续优化。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3980":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-87","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkmetastore","content":"`curvine-server/src/worker/storage/spdk_meta_store.rs`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3981":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-88","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#spdkmetastore","content":"`SpdkMetaStore` 是基于 RocksDB 的持久化 map：`block_id → (dir_id, offset, size, len, finalized)`。block 创建和 finalize 时会写入 metadata，Worker 重启时会从中恢复。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3982":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-89","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#读路径","content":"handler 调用 `SpdkBdev::read_region(enable_send_file, len)`，从 bdev 当前偏移开始读取。底层 `spdk_read()` 会将大读请求拆成 DMA buffer 大小的 chunk（默认 1 MB），并通过 poller 逐个处理：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3983":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-90","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#读路径","content":"通过 crossbeam channel 向 poller 线程提交 `IoRequest`。如果 poller 处于 idle 状态，则通过 `eventfd` 唤醒它。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3984":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-91","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#读路径","content":"handler 阻塞在条件变量上等待完成。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3985":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-92","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#读路径","content":"poller 向 NVMe-oF target 提交 `spdk_nvme_ns_cmd_read`，轮询完成事件，然后通知 handler。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3986":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-93","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#读路径","content":"handler 将数据从 DMA buffer 拷贝到堆上的 `BytesMut`，再进入下一个 chunk。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3987":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-94","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#读路径","content":"所有 I/O 都会按块对齐（向下对齐到设备 block size）。未对齐读会读取完整的对齐 block，再把请求范围内的字节提取到结果中。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3988":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-95","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#写路径","content":"NVMe 命令要求 offset 和 length 都按块对齐。当写 offset 或 length 未对齐设备 block size 时，需要执行一次**读-改-写**流程：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3989":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-96","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#写路径","content":"将完整的对齐 block 读入 DMA buffer（例如，在 offset 7 写入时，会从 offset 0 读取 4096 字节）","locale":"zh-cn"},"3990":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-97","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#写路径","content":"将用户数据拷贝到 DMA buffer 中正确的位置，并保留写入范围之外的字节","locale":"zh-cn"},"3991":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-98","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#写路径","content":"对完整的对齐 block 提交写命令","locale":"zh-cn"},"3992":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-99","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#写路径","content":"对于对齐写，只需要执行第 3 步，即直接提交 NVMe write 命令。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3993":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-100","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#dma-缓冲区管理","content":"读写缓冲区默认都是 `dma_buf_size` 1 MB，在 `SpdkBdev::open()` 时预分配","locale":"zh-cn"},"3994":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-101","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#dma-缓冲区管理","content":"更大的 I/O 会拆成 `dma_buf_size` 大小的 chunk，并串行处理","locale":"zh-cn"},"3995":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-102","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#dma-缓冲区管理","content":"每个 chunk 都需要一次 DMA memcpy：读路径是 `DmaBuf → heap BytesMut`，写路径是 `heap → DmaBuf`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3996":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-103","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#对齐约束","content":"NVMe 命令要求 offset 和 length 都按块对齐：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3997":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-104","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#对齐约束","content":"对于写入，未对齐 offset 或 length 会触发读-改-写流程（见写路径）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3998":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-105","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#配置","content":"待补充","locale":"zh-cn"},"3999":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-106","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#快速开始","content":"待补充","locale":"zh-cn"},"4000":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-107","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#优化实验下一步","content":"**Target 侧混合模式**：将 active/idle 状态切换应用到 SPDK NVMe-oF target，在空闲时降低 CPU 使用率。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4001":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-108","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#优化实验下一步","content":"**分配器改进**：在高负载下提升性能，减少碎片、锁竞争和时间复杂度。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4002":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-109","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#优化实验下一步","content":"**I/O 提交与轮询**：尝试批量提交和多 poller 方案，以扩展吞吐能力。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4003":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-110","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#代码参考","content":"| 文件                        | 作用                              |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `orpc/src/io/spdk_env.rs` | 全局 SPDK 环境初始化、SpdkEnvState 生命周期 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4004":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-111","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture#代码参考","content":"| 文件                           | 作用                                                |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `orpc/src/io/spdk_poller.rs` | Poller 线程、I/O 提交、完成回调、IoOp/IoRequest/IoCompletion |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4005":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture-112","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/spdk-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architectur