ted-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`negative_timeout = 0` 表示关闭负查找缓存，而不是“永久缓存”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4815":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-309","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`direct_io` 与 `write_back_cache` 不能同时启用，启动时会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4816":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-310","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`fuse_opts` 支持 VFS 选项对 `ro`/`rw`、`nodev`/`dev`、`nosuid`/`suid`、`noexec`/`exec`、`noatime`/`atime`、`sync`/`async`，以及 `dirsync`、`allow_other`、`default_permissions`、`big_write`。旧版 libfuse 选项 `auto_unmount`、`allow_root`、`max_write` 不受直接挂载后端支持。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4817":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-311","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"时长值支持字符串（`\"1s\"`、`\"500ms\"`、`\"1h\"`）或按毫秒解释的裸整数。旧的 `*_ms` 键仍作为别名接受。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4818":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-312","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"`curvine-web` 是一个独立进程（二进制 `curvine-web`，通过 `bin/curvine-web.sh start` 启动），提供管理控制台：集群总览、文件浏览、Worker 列表、配置与监控大盘。它不由 `curvine-server` 启动，也不在本地集群辅助脚本的启动列表中；需要 UI 时请单独启动。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4819":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-313","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"| 字段         | 默认值         | 含义         |\n| ---------- | ----------- | ---------- |\n| `hostname` | `localhost` | 管理控制台监听主机名 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"4820":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-314","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"| 字段     | 默认值    | 含义            |\n| ------ | ------ | ------------- |\n| `port` | `9000` | 管理控制台 HTTP 端口 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"4821":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-315","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"`[master].web_port`（`9010`）只是一个指标监听端口，用浏览器打开它只会得到 Prometheus 文本输出，不是管理界面。UI 请访问 `[web].port`（`9000`）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4822":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-316","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"管理控制台内嵌了自己的采集器和时序库，因此不依赖 Prometheus 也能看大盘。把 `mode` 改成 `prometheus` 或 `auto` 可改为查询已有的 Prometheus。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4823":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-317","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段        | 默认值    | 含义         |\n| --------- | ------ | ---------- |\n| `enabled` | `true` | 是否启用可观测性组件 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4824":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-318","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段     | 默认值       | 含义                              |\n| ------ | --------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `mode` | `builtin` | `builtin`、`prometheus` 或 `auto` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4825":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-319","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段                | 默认值   | 含义         |\n| ----------------- | ----- | ---------- |\n| `scrape_interval` | `60s` | 内置采集器的抓取间隔 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4826":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-320","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段               | 默认值  | 含义      |\n| ---------------- | ---- | ------- |\n| `scrape_timeout` | `3s` | 单目标抓取超时 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4827":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-321","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段          | 默认值   | 含义        |\n| ----------- | ----- | --------- |\n| `retention` | `24h` | 内存时序库保留窗口 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4828":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-322","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段                       | 默认值  | 含义     |\n| ------------------------ | ---- | ------ |\n| `max_concurrent_scrapes` | `32` | 并发抓取上限 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4829":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-323","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段                                 | 默认值 | 含义              |\n| ---------------------------------- | --- | --------------- |\n| `max_concurrent_dashboard_queries` | `8` | 单次大盘刷新的并发范围查询上限 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4830":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-324","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段           | 默认值      | 含义     |\n| ------------ | -------- | ------ |\n| `max_series` | `100000` | 序列基数上限 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4831":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-325","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段                       | 默认值     | 含义         |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | ---------- |\n| `max_samples_per_series` | `10000` | 每个序列保留的样本数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4832":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-326","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"FUSE 指标抓取默认关闭。`enabled = true` 且 `targets` 为空时，采集器会抓取 `127.0.0.1:{fuse.web_port}`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4833":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-327","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"| 字段        | 默认值     | 含义                         |\n| --------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `enabled` | `false` | 是否发现并抓取 FUSE `/metrics` 端点 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-11"},"4834":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-328","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"| 字段        | 默认值  | 含义                                             |\n| --------- | ---- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `targets` | `[]` | `host:port` 或完整的 `http://host:port/metrics` 地址 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-11"},"4835":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-329","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| 字段    | 默认值 | 含义                                          |\n| ----- | --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `url` | 空   | Prometheus 基础地址，例如 `http://prometheus:9090` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"4836":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-330","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| 字段              | 默认值  | 含义                   |\n| --------------- | ---- | -------------------- |\n| `query_timeout` | `5s` | Prometheus 查询 API 超时 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"4837":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-331","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| 字段                 | 默认值    | 含义                                        |\n| ------------------ | ------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `fallback_builtin` | `true` | `mode = \"auto\"` 时，Prometheus 不可用则回退到内置采集器 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"4838":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-332","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| 字段                 | 默认值   | 含义                        |\n| ------------------ | ----- | ------------------------- |\n| `target_cache_ttl` | `30s` | `/api/v1/targets` 响应的缓存时长 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"4839":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-333","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"当 `mode = \"prometheus\"` 时，还需要按 `etc/prometheus-curvine.yml` 中的说明加上目标标签，大盘才能把指标归属到正确的角色。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4840":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-334","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"S3 兼容网关是一个独立服务（二进制 `curvine-s3-gateway`，通过 `bin/curvine-s3-gateway.sh start` 启动）。本段只被网关进程读取，Master 和 Worker 会忽略它。支持的 API 范围见 S3 对象存储网关。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4841":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-335","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Clus