ted-Mode/k8s-Deployment#架构说明","content":"| 资源                         | 说明                                |\n| -------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| Service `curvine-transfer` | 集群内 Transfer RPC 与 Web 端点，仅在启用时创建 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4962":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#架构说明","content":"默认 `openKruise.enabled=false`，StatefulSet 使用 `apps/v1`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4963":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#transfer-服务","content":"Transfer 是用于独立调度 Load 和 Export 的可选服务。仅当 `transfer.enabled=true` 时，Chart 才会创建 `curvine-transfer` Deployment 和 Service；在此之前，Master 提供旧的 Load API。启用 Transfer 不需要修改 Master 或 Worker 配置。若要在 Chart 之外部署 Transfer，参见\nKubernetes 部署 Transfer。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4964":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#启用-transfer","content":"使用包含 Transfer 二进制的 Curvine 镜像版本；不要只因 Chart 支持以下参数就使用较旧的镜像 tag。高可用或多副本部署时，必须先保证 MySQL 可达，再启动 Transfer Pod：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4965":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#启用-transfer","content":"Chart 会创建仅集群内可见的 `curvine-transfer` `ClusterIP` Service，并将其 FQDN 写入 `[transfer].hostname`。Curvine 根据该 hostname 和 `transfer.rpcPort` 自动推导 RPC 地址；常规 Helm 部署不要配置 `endpoints`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4966":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#启用-transfer","content":"`transfer.storeUrl` 为空时使用单 Pod SQLite 默认值。Chart 会为其数据目录创建 `ReadWriteOnce` PVC，且不设置 `storageClassName`，因此 Kubernetes 自动使用默认 StorageClass；Pod 被替换后数据仍会保留。`transfer.replicas > 1` 时 MySQL 是必需的，高可用部署也建议使用 MySQL。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4967":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#启用-transfer","content":"SQLite 模式下，Transfer Deployment 使用 `Recreate`，使旧 Pod 在新 Pod 启动前释放 `ReadWriteOnce` 卷。Helm 卸载时会保留 SQLite PVC；只有明确丢弃 Transfer 元数据时才手动删除它。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4968":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#启用-transfer","content":"生成的 ConfigMap 同时供 Master、Worker 和 Transfer 使用。集群外 CLI 主机也必须使用 `[transfer] enabled = true` 的集群配置；客户端命令仍是 `cv load`、`cv export`、`cv load-status` 和 `cv cancel-load`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4969":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#验证","content":"Web UI：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4970":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#master-地址","content":"单副本：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4971":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#master-地址","content":"三副本：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4972":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#升级","content":"`master.replicas` 安装后不可修改。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4973":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#故障排查","content":"| 现象          | 命令                                       | 原因                  |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| Pod Pending | `kubectl describe pod -n curvine <name>` | 资源不足；无 StorageClass |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"4974":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#故障排查","content":"| 现象         | 命令                                         | 原因       |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------ | -------- |\n| master 启动慢 | `kubectl logs curvine-master-0 -n curvine` | Raft 回放中 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"4975":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-51","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#故障排查","content":"| 现象          | 命令               | 原因               |\n| ----------- | ---------------- | ---------------- |\n| PVC Pending | `kubectl get sc` | 无可用 StorageClass |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"4976":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-52","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#配置参考","content":"Chart 版本 `0.5.2-alpha`。下表默认值与 `helm show values curvine/curvine --version 0.5.2-alpha` 一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4977":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-53","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#全局","content":"| 参数                     | 默认值             | 说明              |\n| ---------------------- | --------------- | --------------- |\n| `global.clusterDomain` | `cluster.local` | Kubernetes 集群域名 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"4978":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-54","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#集群","content":"| 参数           | 默认值       | 说明    |\n| ------------ | --------- | ----- |\n| `cluster.id` | `curvine` | 集群 ID |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"4979":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Dep