s/Deploy/kubernetes-quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/kubernetes-quick-start#故障排查","content":"| 现象                               | 检查                                                                                                               |\n| -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| master 或 worker Pod 处于 `Pending` | `kubectl describe pod -n curvine <pod>`。通常是 Docker 内存不足，或没有 `standard` StorageClass（`kubectl get storageclass`）。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"5498":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/kubernetes-quick-start-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/kubernetes-quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/kubernetes-quick-start#故障排查","content":"| 现象                                  | 检查                                                                                                                           |\n| ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| PVC `curvine-test-pvc` 一直 `Pending` | `kubectl logs -n curvine-system -l app=curvine-csi-controller -c csi-plugin`。确认 `kubectl get pods -n curvine` 中 master 正在运行。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"5499":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/kubernetes-quick-start-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/kubernetes-quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/kubernetes-quick-start#故障排查","content":"| 现象                            | 检查                                                                                                                                       |\n| ----------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 测试 Pod 卡在 `ContainerCreating` | `kubectl describe pod curvine-test`，然后 `kubectl logs