ker）、**接入层**（客户端：FUSE、SDK、CLI），共同完成数据的存储、处理和管理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5547":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"Curvine 由三个主要服务器端角色加上客户端和 UFS 组成：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5548":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**Curvine 客户端**：数据读写操作由客户端实现，通过 RPC 调用 Curvine 服务器端接口（从 Master 获取元数据，从 Worker 获取块数据）。客户端支持多种访问方式：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5549":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**FUSE 挂载**：通过 libfuse/3 的 POSIX 兼容挂载 (curvine-fuse)","locale":"zh-cn"},"5550":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**HDFS & SDK**：Java / Python / libsdk 接口","locale":"zh-cn"},"5551":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**CSI 驱动**：Kubernetes 卷驱动 (curvine-csi)","locale":"zh-cn"},"5552":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**CLI (`cv`)**：文件系统操作、报告和集群管理的管理工具","locale":"zh-cn"},"5553":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"内部，客户端层由以下组成：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5554":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**UnifiedFileSystem**：提供 CurvineFS