b**：管理 UI 和集群管理","locale":"zh-cn"},"5589":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**Metrics**：基于 Prometheus 的监控（master/worker/client、job、cache）","locale":"zh-cn"},"5590":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"部署拓扑与组件角色见 部署架构；内部数据流（journal、回放、客户端读写）见 基本架构。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5591":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#高性能设计","content":"Curvine为了实现高性能、高并发、低资源消耗的目标，采用了以下技术和设计原则：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5592":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#高性能设计","content":"**纯Rust实现**：Curvine 采用纯 Rust 语言实现，避免了传统语言的性能瓶颈和资源消耗，同时也保证了代码的安全性和稳定性。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5593":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-51","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#高性能设计","content":"**高性能RPC框架**：Curvine实现了自定义rpc通信框架，支持高效的数据传输，在框架内实现了异步IO和零拷贝；","locale":"zh-cn"},"5594":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-52","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#高性能设计","content":"**零成本抽象**： 零成本抽象设计，核心模块直接对接底层系统，避免了不必要的抽象层，提高了系统性能和资源利用率。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5595":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-53","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#高性能设计","content":"**异步IO**：异步IO设计，充分利用了系统资源，避免了阻塞等待，提高了系统的并发处理能力。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5596":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-54","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#高性能设计","content":"**零拷贝**：零拷贝设计，避免了数据的复制和内存的分配，减少了系统的内存占用和资源消耗。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5597":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-55","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#高可用设计","content":"Curvine 采用分布式架构设计，通过多副本机制和故障转移机制保证系统的高可用性。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5598":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-56","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#高可用设计","content":"**Raft协议**：使用用 Raft 协议实现分布式一致性，保证数据的一致性和可靠性。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5599":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-57","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#高可用设计","content":"**故障转移机制**：故障自动转移，当主节点故障时，自动切换到备用节点，保证系统的高可用性。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5600":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-58","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#高可用设计","content":"**多副本机制**：多副本机制，保证数据的冗余备份，提高系统的可靠性和容错能力。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5601":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-59","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#高可用设计","content":"**快照机制**：轻量级快照机制，定期备份数据，提高系统的恢复速度和稳定性。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5602":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview","type":"page","content":"Overview","breadcrumbs":["Documents","概述"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview","locale":"zh-cn"},"5603":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","type":"page","content":"Curvine简介","breadcrumbs":["Documents","概述"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","locale":"zh-cn"},"5604":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#核心特性","content":"核心特性","locale":"zh-cn"},"5605":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#使用场景","content":"使用场景","locale":"zh-cn"},"5606":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#性能表现","content":"性能表现","locale":"zh-cn"},"5607":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#-模块化架构","content":"🧩 模块化架构","locale":"zh-cn"},"5608":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","content":"Curvine 是一个使用 Rust 编写的高性能分布式缓存系统，采用 Apache 2.0 开源协议发布。它在外部存储系统之上提供统一的缓存文件系统视图，兼顾低延迟元数据访问、高吞吐数据访问以及 POSIX 兼容的 FUSE 集成。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5609":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","content":"Curvine 采用经典的 Master / Worker 架构。Master 负责元数据与集群协调，Worker 负责数据块存储与读写服务；元数据一致性与高可用通过 Raft 保证。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5610":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","content":"Curvine 面向 AI、分析型计算和数据基础设施场景，当前 `main` 分支提供的主要接入方式包括 Rust CLI、FUSE 和 Java / Python SDK 绑定。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5611":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#核心特性","content":"**多云底层存储支持**：可对接 S3 兼容系统、HDFS、OSS、MinIO 等 UFS 后端，并提供统一访问层","locale":"zh-cn"},"5612":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#核心特性","content":"**云原生集成**：支持 CSI 与 Kubernetes 部署场景","locale":"zh-cn"},"5613":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#核心特性","content":"**多级缓存**：支持内存、SSD、HDD 多层缓存策略","locale":"zh-cn"},"5614":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#核心特性","content":"**POSIX 兼容访问**：通过 FUSE 将缓存数据以本地文件系统方式暴露给现有应用","locale":"zh-cn"},"5615":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#核心特性","content":"**兼容 HDFS 生态**：提供 Hadoop FileSystem 与 SDK 接入路径","locale":"zh-cn"},"5616":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#核心特性","content":"**高性能**：基于异步 I/O 与零拷贝导向的数据路径，面向低延迟和高吞吐负载","locale":"zh-cn"},"5617":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#核心特性","content":"**Raft 元数据高可用**：通过 Raft 保证 Master 元数据一致性","locale":"zh-cn"},"5618":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#核心特性","content":"**内建可观测性**：暴露监控与指标，便于集群运维","locale":"zh-cn"},"5619":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#核心特性","content":"**Web 管理界面**：在服务 Web 端口提供浏览器管理与状态查看能力","locale":"zh-cn"},"5620":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#使用场景","content":"Curvine 为高性能、高并发以及海量数据缓存设计，可以在很多场景中使用：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5621":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/introduction#使用场景","content":"**为深度学习训练提