ser-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#1-启动网关","content":"从源码构建时，`build/build.sh` 会把二进制放进发行目录（默认 `--package all` 已包含它）。只想单独构建网关时：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5844":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#1-启动网关","content":"二进制文件输出到 `target/release/curvine-s3-gateway`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5845":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#2-配置集群连接","content":"网关复用常规的 Curvine 集群配置文件。为网关相关设置添加 `[s3_gateway]` 部分；`[client]`、`[master]` 等其他部分用于连接集群：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5846":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#2-配置集群连接","content":"所有选项见 配置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5847":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-73","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#3-创建凭据","content":"网关没有内置的默认凭据。请生成密钥对并写入凭据存储：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5848":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-74","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#3-创建凭据","content":"或注册已有的密钥对（access key 长度必须为 16–32 个字符，secret key 为 16–64 个字符）：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5849":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-75","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#3-创建凭据","content":"以上命令使用配置文件所选的凭据存储。详见 凭据管理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5850":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-76","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/d