      |\n| ---------- | ------------ | ----------- |\n| `--region` | S3 region 标识 | `us-east-1` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5857":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-83","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数                   | 描述       | 默认值                |\n| -------------------- | -------- | ------------------ |\n| `--credentials-path` | 覆盖凭据存储路径 | `[s3_gateway]` 中的值 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5858":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-84","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数      | 描述                 | 默认值 |\n| ------- | ------------------ | --- |\n| `serve` | 可选子命令；不带子命令时直接启动服务 | —   |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5859":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-85","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数                                      | 描述      | 默认值 |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------- | --- |\n| `credential add\\|generate\\|list\\|stats` | 凭据管理子命令 | —   |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5860":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-86","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数       | 类型     | 默认值              | 描述      |\n| -------- | ------ | ---------------- | ------- |\n| `listen` | string | `\"0.0.0.0:9900\"` | 监听地址和端口 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5861":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-87","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数       | 类型     | 默认值           | 描述           |\n| -------- | ------ | ------------- | ------------ |\n| `region` | string | `\"us-east-1\"` | S3 region 标识 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5862":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-88","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数             | 类型     | 默认值                   | 描述                             |\n| -------------- | ------ | --------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `put_temp_dir` | string | `\"/tmp/curvine-temp\"` | 本地存储模式下 PUT 操作（普通上传和分片上传）的临时目录 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5863":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-89","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                            | 类型      | 默认值       | 描述                      |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | --------- | ----------------------- |\n| `put_memory_buffer_threshold` | integer | `1048576` | PUT 时小于该大小（字节）的对象缓存在内存中 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5864":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-90","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                      | 类型      | 默认值        | 描述                  |\n| ----------------------- | ------- | ---------- | ------------------- |\n| `put_max_memory_buffer` | integer | `16777216` | PUT 时内存缓冲区的最大大小（字节） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5865":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-91","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                  | 类型    | 默认值   | 描述               |\n| ------------------- | ----- | ----- | ---------------- |\n| `get_chunk_size_mb` | float | `1.0` | GET 响应的读写块大小（MB） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5866":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-92","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                        | 类型      | 默认值     | 描述                         |\n| ------------------------- | ------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `enable_distributed_auth` | boolean | `false` | 将凭据存储在 Curvine 中，而不是本地文件系统 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5867":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-93","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                 | 类型     | 默认值 | 描述     |\n| ------------------ | ------ | --- | ------ |\n| `credentials_path` | string | 见下文 | 凭据存储路径 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5868":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-94","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                            | 类型      | 默认值  | 描述          |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | ---- | ----------- |\n| `cache_refresh_interval_secs` | integer | `30` | 凭据缓存刷新间隔（秒） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5869":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-95","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"`[worker]` 部分的 `worker.enable_s3_gateway` 用于启用分布式分片存储：分片数据写入 Curvine 的 `/.s3temp`，而不是 `put_temp_dir`，因此任意网关实例都可以完成上传。设置该项也会使二进制切换到分布式凭据存储。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5870":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-96","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"**凭据存储路径：**","locale":"zh-cn"},"5871":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-97","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"本地模式（`enable_distributed_auth = false`）：默认 `~/.curvine/credentials.jsonl`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5872":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-98","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"分布式模式（`enable_distributed_auth = true`）：默认 `/system/auth/credentials.jsonl`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5873":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-99","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"**配置示例：**","locale":"zh-cn"},"5874":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-100","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#凭据管理","content":"凭据以 JSONL 格式存储，每行一个条目：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5875":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-101","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#环境变量","content":"| 变量                                         | 描述         |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ---------- |\n| `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` 或 `CURVINE_ACCESS_KEY` | Access key |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"5876":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-102","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#环境变量","content":"| 变量                                             | 描述         |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ---------- |\n| `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY` 或 `CURVINE_SECRET_KEY` | Secret key |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"5877":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-103","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#环境变量","content":"| 变量         | 描述                                                       |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `RUST_LOG` | 日志级别（例如 `info`、`debug`、`curvine_s3_gateway::auth=debug`） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"5878":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-104","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#环境变量","content":"仅当配置的凭据存储为空时，网关才会导入环境变量中的凭据；导入的密钥对会写入本地凭据存储。如果既没有已存储的凭据，也没有环境变量凭据，网关将以空存储启动，并拒绝所有请求。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5879":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-105","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令","content":"`credential list --show-secrets` 和 `credential generate` 会将 secret key 打印到终端。请将该输出视为敏感信息，避免写入 shell 历史或共享日志。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5880":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-106","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#使用示例","content":"以下示例使用 `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` 和 `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`。请先导出在 快速开始 中创建的密钥对：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5881":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-107","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#range-请求","content":"Range 响应使用状态码 `206`，并包含 `Content-Range` 头。签名请求最简单的生成方式是使用 S3 SDK 或 AWS CLI。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5882":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-108","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#分片上传-1","content":"`AbortMultipartUpload` 尚未路由，因此放弃的上传会在临时存储目录中留下分片，需要手动清理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5883":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-109","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#单实例","content":"请通过进程管理工具（systemd、supervisor、Kubernetes）运行该二进制。目前尚未提供 start/stop 脚本：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5884":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-110","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#多实例","content":"除临时分片数据和凭据外，网关是无状态的，因此可以部署在负载均衡之后：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5885":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-111","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#多实例","content":"当网关实例多于一个时，请启用分布式分片存储和分布式凭据，使任意实例都能完成上传：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5886":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-112","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#多实例","content":"如果未启用分布式存储，分片会保留在接收该分片的实例本地 `put_temp_dir` 中；路由到其他实例的 `CompleteMultipartUpload` 将找不到这些分片。另一种方式是在负载均衡上配置会话保持。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5887":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-113","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#监控与日志","content":"网关通过 `tracing` 将日志输出到 stdout。可以使用 `RUST_LOG` 调整日志级别：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5888":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-114","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#监控与日志","content":"日志覆盖请求处理、认证失败、分片操作和文件系统错误。目前没有 metrics 端点；请使用 `/healthz` 端点进行存活检查。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5889":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-115","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"未实现 `CopyObject`；客户端