"5897":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-123","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#性能调优","content":"对于大对象场景，可以提高 `get_chunk_size_mb`，并确保 `put_temp_dir` 位于快速本地存储上。当 `worker.enable_s3_gateway = true` 时，分片会直接写入 Curvine，不会使用 `put_temp_dir`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5898":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"page","content":"SDK 访问","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","接入方式"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","locale":"zh-cn"},"5899":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"概览","locale":"zh-cn"},"5900":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#rust-sdk","content":"Rust SDK","locale":"zh-cn"},"5901":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#java-sdk","content":"Java SDK","locale":"zh-cn"},"5902":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"Hadoop FileSystem","locale":"zh-cn"},"5903":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#java-api","content":"Java API","locale":"zh-cn"},"5904":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#python-sdk","content":"Python SDK","locale":"zh-cn"},"5905":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"通用配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"5906":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","content":"Curvine 提供多语言 SDK，使应用可通过 RPC 访问 Curvine 文件系统（元数据访问 Master，块数据访问 Worker），而无需使用 FUSE。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5907":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"| SDK      | 包 / 模块                              | 适用场景             |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| **Rust** | `curvine-client` / `curvine-libsdk` | 原生 Rust 应用、高性能场景 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5908":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"| SDK      | 包 / 模块                                                                                              | 适用场景                        |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Java** | `io.curvine.CurvineFileSystem`（Hadoop `FileSystem`，scheme 为 `cv://`），以及 `curvine-libsdk` 的 Java SDK | Hadoop/Spark/Flink 等 JVM 应用 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5909":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"| SDK        | 包 / 模块                                                          | 适用场景                      |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| **Python** | `curvinefs` —— `CurvineClient`（原生）与 `CurvineFileSystem`（fsspec） | 机器学习、数据流水线、pandas/dask、脚本 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5910":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"所有 SDK 均需在 Curvine 集群（Master 与 Worker）已启动、且客户端配置正确（如 `curvine-cluster.toml` 中的 `master_addrs`）的前提下使用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5911":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#rust-sdk","content":"通过 `curvine-client`（或 `curvine-libsdk` 暴露的 Rust API）编程式创建文件、读写数据、列举目录。配置通常从 `curvine-cluster.toml` 或环境变量加载。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5912":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#rust-sdk","content":"构建与用法参见 开发指南 及 Curvine 源码仓库（如 `curvine-client`、`curvine-libsdk` 及 `curvine-tests` 下的集成测试）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5913":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"Hadoop 路径使用的 URI scheme 是 **`cv://`**（不是 `fs.cv://`），实现类是 `io.curvine.CurvineFileSystem`，因此 `FileSystem.get(URI.create(\"cv://default/path\"), conf)` 会返回 Curvine 客户端。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5914":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"`FilesystemConf` 的每个字段都按 `fs.cv.<字段名>` 读取——是 `fs.cv.master_addrs`，不是 `fs.cv.default.master_addrs`。`curvine-cluster.toml` 中 `[client]` 下的配置都可以用这种方式覆盖，且 `-D` 系统属性优先级高于配置文件。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5915":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"可选键：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5916":