nuals/Key-Features/ufs-97","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#八总结","content":"外部 UFS 数据变更后，`fs_mode` 必须手动 `resync` 同步元数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"6507":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-98","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#八总结","content":"释放缓存用 `free` 命令，安全不删原始数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"6508":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","type":"page","content":"命令行工具","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","运维管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","locale":"zh-cn"},"6509":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"原生 CLI：`cv`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6510":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"1. `report`：查看集群状态","locale":"zh-cn"},"6511":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node管理-worker-节点","content":"2. `node`：管理 Worker 节点","locale":"zh-cn"},"6512":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"3. `fs`：文件系统操作","locale":"zh-cn"},"6513":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"4. `mount`：将 UFS 挂载到 Curvine","locale":"zh-cn"},"6514":{"id":"/zh