t size, catching ABI drift immediately."],[3936,"**`curvine_*` C 辅助函数**：用小型 C wrapper 在已知偏移处设置结构体字段。例如 Rust 调用 `curvine_spdk_async_ctx_init(...)`，而不是直接操作 C 结构体字段。初始化时会通过运行时 `sizeof()` 检查比较 Rust 缓冲区大小和真实 C 结构体大小，一旦 ABI 漂移就能立即发现。"],[2331,"**`CurvineClient`** — native bindings, explicit config, chunks you control:"],[5927,"**`CurvineClient`**——原生绑定，配置显式、chunk 大小可控："],[2332,"**`CurvineFileSystem`** — an fsspec implementation, registered as the\n`curvinefs` spec, so pandas, dask, and anything fsspec-aware can read the\ncluster directly:"],[5928,"**`CurvineFileSystem`**——fsspec 实现，注册为 `curvinefs` spec，因此 pandas、dask 等支持 fsspec 的库可以直接读取集群："],[3262,"**`mode = \"diagnose\"` (default):** incompatible peers are allowed, and the\nmaster logs a warning describing the peer, its version, and the expected\nbound. This is the safe default and never breaks an existing mixed-version\ncluster."],[6855,"**`mode = \"diagnose\"`（默认）：** 不兼容的 peer 被允许，master 记录告警，内容包括 peer、其版本和期望的边界。这是安全默认值，不会破坏已有的混合版本集群。"],[3263,"**`mode = \"enforce\"`:** incompatible peers are rejected with an explicit\nerror that includes the actual peer version and the upgrade suggestion."],[6856,"**`mode = \"enforce\"`：** 不兼容的 peer 被拒绝，错误信息包含实际 peer 版本和升级建议。"],[3217,"**0.3.x legacy workers / clients with 0.4.x master.** Workers and clients\nrunning 0.3.x (or earlier) do not send structured `component_info`. The master\ndetects them as legacy peers: allowed with a warning in `diagnose` mode\n(default), rejected only in `enforce` mode. No data loss or protocol error\noccurs; the master simply cannot verify their protocol version, release\nversion, or capabilities."],[6810,"**0.3.x 旧版 worker / client 对接 0.4.x master。** 运行 0.3.x（或更早）的 worker 和 client 不上报结构化 `component_info`。master 将其识别为旧版 peer：`diagnose` 模式（默认）下允许并告警，仅在 `enforce` 模式下拒绝。不会发生数据丢失或协议错误，master 只是无法校验它们的协议版本、发布版本或能力。"],[2033,"**1. Metadata operation performance**"],[5627,"**1. 元数据操作性能**"],[2057,"**2. Data Read/Write Performance**"],[5651,"**2. 数据读写性能**"],[2116,"**3. Resource consumption**"],[5710,"**3. 资源消耗情况**"],[3028,"**About `--provider`**: some URI schemes can map to multiple implementations. For example, `oss://...` may be handled either by OSS-HDFS / JindoSDK or by OpenDAL, so `--provider` lets you force the implementation."],[372,"**Acquire**: Pop a cached qpair (zero FFI). If pool is empty, call `curvine_spdk_alloc_io_qpair` to allocate a new one."],[3960,"**Acquire**：弹出一个缓存 qpair（零 FFI）。如果池为空，则调用 `curvine_spdk_alloc_io_qpair` 分配新 qpair。"],[3326,"**Active Worker Count**: Real-time display of currently online Worker nodes"],[352,"**Active**: Drains the incoming request channel, submits NVMe commands via `spdk_nvme_ns_cmd_read`/`write`, polls qpairs for completions, and invokes per-I/O callbacks. When the queue is empty, it spins for `spin_iter` iterations before transitioning to Idle. This **spin-before-park** avoids an `eventfd` wake round-trip when the next I/O arrives immediately, keeping the poller in a low-overhead polling loop instead of a syscall-heavy park/unpark cycle."],[3940,"**Active**：从请求 channel 中取出待处理请求，通过 `spdk_nvme_ns_cmd_read`/`write` 提交 NVMe 命令，轮询 qpair 完成队列，并调用每个 I/O 的回调。队列为空后，它会先自旋 `spin_iter` 次再切回 Idle。这种 **spin-before-park** 策略避免了下一个 I/O 紧接到来时产生一次 `eventfd` 唤醒往返，使 poller 保持在低开销轮询循环中，而不是频繁执行 park/unpark 系统调用。"],[280,"**Alibaba Cloud OSS**: Alibaba Cloud object storage service, supports `oss://` protocol"],[194,"**Allocate blocks**: The client requests new blocks from the Master. The Master chooses Worker(s) (and replicas if needed), records block allocations in the journal (e.g. `AddBlock`, `CompleteFile`), and returns block locations to the client."],[413,"**Allocator improvements**: Enhance performance, reduce fragmentation, contention, and time complexity under high workload."],[3475,"**Always use FUSE3** in production — FUSE2 delivers only ~50% of FUSE3 throughput."],[7068,"**Always use FUSE3** in production — FUSE2 delivers only ~50% of FUSE3 throughput."],[279,"**Amazon S3**: AWS object storage service, supports `s3://` and `s3a://` protocols"],[3867,"**Amazon S3**：AWS 的对象存储服务，支持 `s3://` 和 `s3a://` 协议"],[2028,"**Analytical Databases and OLAP Engines**: Provides high-speed caching for analytical databases and OLAP engines, significantly improving complex query performance and reducing data analysis time"],[1728,"**Application Layer**: Includes curvine-fuse, applications accessed via SDK, CLI management tools, etc. For details, refer to Access Methods."],[898,"**Approve deliberately.** Drafts exist for a reason. Check the issue, PR body, or review comment before saying yes."],[245,"**Asynchronous data copy**: the actual data blocks of files are asynchronously copied from Curvine to UFS in the background. The copy process does not affect local metadata read/write operations and avoids slowing down write speed. If UFS is temporarily unavailable, the copy task automatically retries until synchronization succeeds."],[2000,"**Asynchronous I/O**: Asynchronous I/O design fully utilizes system resources, avoiding blocking waits and improving system concurrent processing capabilities"],[199,"**AsyncThrough** (default): Data is written to Curvine first (return immediately), then asynchronously synced to UFS."],[3787,"**AsyncThrough**（默认）：先写 Curvine 后立即返回，再异步同步到 UFS。"],[2004,"**Automatic Failover**: Automatic failover mechanism that switches to backup nodes when primary nodes fail, ensuring system high availability"],[3351,"**Available Capacity Display**: Shows the currently available storage capacity"],[3331,"**Available Storage Space**: Shows remaining available storage space"],[282,"**Azure Blob Storage**: Microsoft Azure object storage, supports `azblob://` protocol"],[3870,"**Azure Blob Storage**：Microsoft Azure 的对象存储，支持 `azblob://` 协议"],[2029,"**Big Data Computing**: Provides high-speed caching for big data computing scenarios, reducing data read/write time"],[388,"**Block alignment**: All offsets are aligned down to the device block size. This is required by the NVMe specification — unaligned DMA addresses cause controller errors."],[1961,"**BlockClient Pool**: Manages block_reader / block_writer for local and remote access"],[5556,"**BlockClient Pool**：管理本地和远程访问的 block_reader / block_writer"],[1976,"**BlockStore**: Manages block lifecycle and local storage"],[5571,"**BlockStore**：管理块生命周期和本地存储"],[873,"**Body:** Summary, Issue Describe / Design, Changes, Test verified, and Dependencies"],[3340,"**Breadcrumb Navigation**: Shows the complete directory hierarchy structure"],[1522,"**Building:** `make build` / `make all` — Build; output in `build/dist`. `make dist` — Build and create tar.gz in project root. `make dist-only` — Package existing `build/dist` only."],[2023,"**Built-in observability**: Exposes monitoring and metrics for cluster components"],[192,"**Cache hit**: If the path is under a Curvine-native file (not a UFS mount), data is read from Workers as above. For paths under a **UFS mount**, the unified file system and cache behavior apply: the client may serve from Curvine cache when valid, or from UFS on cache miss (with optional automatic caching when TTL is set)."],[197,"**Cache**: Data is written only to Curvine (Workers); not written to UFS."],[3785,"**Cache**：仅写入 Curvine（Worker），不写 UFS。"],[200,"**CacheThrough**: Data is written synchronously to both Curvine and UFS before returning."],[3788,"**CacheThrough**：同步写入 Curvine 与 UFS 后返回。"],[3352,"**Capacity Statistics**: Real-time updated capacity usage information"],[3332,"**Capacity Utilization**: Displays storage usage rate through progress bars and percentages"],[900,"**CI is the referee.** Formatting, compilation, tests, and the PR title check still decide whether a change can land. Skills do not bypass them."],[4487,"**CI 说了算。** 格式化、编译、测试和 PR 标题检查仍然决定一个改动能否合入，skill 不会绕过它们。"],[386,"**Cleanup on close**: Buffers are freed via `curvine_spdk_dma_free` in `SpdkBdev::drop`. If inflight I/Os do not drain before the drop deadline, the buffer pointers are nulled to prevent use-after-free (safe leak)."],[1957,"**CLI (`cv`)**: Admin tools for fs ops, report, and cluster management"],[5552,"**CLI (`cv`)**：文件系统操作、报告和集群管理的管理工具"],[1744,"**Client Library**: Provides multi-language APIs, communicating with Master and Worker nodes via RPC"],[2017,"**Cloud-native integration**: Supports CSI-based deployment and Kubernetes-oriented packaging workflows"],[3390,"**Cluster Comparison**: Compare configuration differences between different environments"],[912,"**Cluster core (required):** Start `curvine-master` and `curvine-worker` on the intended hosts. The cluster is operational once Master and Workers are running; you can use the CLI (`cv`) or SDK without FUSE."],[3322,"**Cluster Status**: Displays whether the cluster is currently active, including uptime information"],[3375,"**cluster_id**: Unique identifier for the cluster"],[6968,"**cluster_id**：集群的唯一标识符"],[226,"**Collaboration logic**: adopts an on-demand loading and divided-response approach. For example, when a user lists the contents of a directory, the in-memory directory tree first quickly returns the names of all files and folders in the directory to ensure response speed. When the user needs to view detailed information about a file, such as size and modification time, the system then performs a batch query in RocksDB for the corresponding detailed information and returns it all at once. This ensures speed without wasting memory resources."],[2942,"**Compatibility wrapper `dfs`**: bundled in the distribution; `fs` / `report` go through Java `CurvineShell` and keep Hadoop `FsShell` style."],[175,"**Components**: `MasterHandler` serves RPC; `MasterFilesystem` and `FsDir` hold the directory/file and block mapping; `JournalWriter` writes entries; `WorkerManager` tracks Workers and block placement; `MountManager` manages UFS mount points."],[2335,"**Config file**: Most SDKs accept a config file path (e.g. `conf/curvine-cluster.toml`). The same file is used by the CLI (`cv`) and FUSE."],[2145,"**Configuration**: The node where FUSE runs must have access to the cluster config (e.g. `conf/curvine-cluster.toml`) and correct Master address."],[2951,"**Conventions:**"],[233,"**Core advantage**: write speed is greatly improved. There is no need to wait for the log to be synchronized to most machines before completing the local modification. Local write latency can be reduced to a few milliseconds. In high-concurrency scenarios, such as creating a large number of small files, throughput can increase several times, perfectly adapting to high-frequency small-operation scenarios."],[232,"**Core process**: the Leader node first updates its own in-memory directory tree, then writes to the local RocksDB to complete the local data modification, and then synchronizes the log of this modification to other Follower nodes in the cluster to complete consistency synchronization."],[2124,"**crates/client**: Rust client core, unified filesystem, transfer job client, and benchmark runner"],[5718,"**crates/client**：Rust 客户端核心、统一文件系统、传输作业客户端与压测运行器"],[2120,"**crates/common**: Shared configuration, protocol, metadata, filesystem, storage, and UFS APIs"],[5714,"**crates/common**：共享配置、协议、元数据、文件系统、存储与 UFS API"],[2119,"**crates/core**: Runtime, RPC, networking, I/O, allocation, metrics, and fault-injection primitives"],[5713,"**crates/core**：运行时、RPC、网络、I/O、内存分配、指标与故障注入基础能力"],[2121,"**crates/metadata**: Raft-based metadata replication"],[5715,"**crates/metadata**：基于 Raft 的元数据复制"],[2123,"**crates/server**: Standalone Transfer service for Load and Export jobs"],[5717,"**crates/server**：独立处理 Load / Export 作业的 Transfer 服务"],[2274,"**Credential store path:**"],[1956,"**CSI Driver**: Kubernetes volume driver (curvine-csi)"],[5551,"**CSI 驱动**：Kubernetes 卷驱动 (curvine-csi)"],[1525,"**CSI:** `make curvine-csi` — Build curvine-csi Docker image."],[5111,"**CSI**：`make curvine-csi` — 构建 curvine-csi 镜像"],[1953,"**Curvine Client**: Data read/write operations are implemented by the client, which calls Curvine server-side interfaces through RPC (metadata from Master, block data from Workers). The client supports multiple access methods:"],[1729,"**Curvine Cluster Service Layer**: Consists of **curvine-master** (can be multiple nodes for HA, forming a Raft group) and **curvine-worker** nodes forming the Curvine cluster."],[2144,"**Curvine cluster** is running (Master and Worker started). See Bare Metal Deployment or Quick Start."],[5548,"**Curvine 客户端**：数据读写操作由客户端实现，通过 RPC 调用 Curvine 服务器端接口（从 Master 获取元数据，从 Worker 获取块数据）。客户端支持多种访问方式："],[5738,"**Curvine 集群**已启动（已启动 Master 与 Worker）。参见 裸机部署 或 快速开始。"],[5324,"**Curvine 集群服务层**：由 **curvine-master**（可多节点部署形成 Raft 组，实现高可用）与 **curvine-worker** 节点共同组成 Curvine 集群。"],[2128,"**curvine-cli**: Native CLI (`cv`) for cluster, mount, fs, and load operations"],[5722,"**curvine-cli**：原生命令行工具 `cv`"],[2130,"**curvine-csi**: CSI driver for Kubernetes storage integration"],[5724,"**curvine-csi**：面向 Kubernetes 的 CSI 驱动"],[2125,"**curvine-fuse**: FUSE daemon for POSIX-style access"],[5719,"**curvine-fuse**：提供 POSIX 访问的 FUSE 守护进程"],[2126,"**curvine-libsdk**: Java and Python SDK bindings built on top of the native client"],[5720,"**curvine-libsdk**：基于原生客户端封装的 Java / Python SDK 绑定"],[2122,"**curvine-server**: Master, Worker, and MDS server implementations (`--service master`, `worker`, or `mds`)"],[5716,"**curvine-server**：Master、Worker 与 MDS 服务端实现（`--service master`、`worker` 或 `mds`）"],[2131,"**curvine-tests**: Integration tests, regression tooling, and benchmark utilities"],[5725,"**curvine-tests**：集成测试、回归工具与基准测试工具"],[2127,"**curvine-ufs** and **crates/adapters**: UFS backends and storage adapters (OpenDAL, OSS-HDFS, HDFS JNI, RocksDB, local and SPDK storage)"],[5721,"**curvine-ufs** 与 **crates/adapters**：UFS 后端与存储适配器（OpenDAL、OSS-HDFS、HDFS JNI、RocksDB、本地与 SPDK 存储）"],[1993,"**curvine-web**: Admin UI and cluster management"],[2129,"**curvine-web**: Web UI assets and server-side web support"],[5723,"**curvine-web**：Web UI 静态资源与服务端 Web 支持"],[5588,"**curvine-web**：管理 UI 和集群管理"],[3335,"**Data Block Statistics**: Displays the count of unique data blocks and replica data blocks"],[191,"**Data**: The client reads block data from the corresponding Worker(s) via block-read RPC. It may use **parallel reads** and **read-ahead** (configurable chunk size, slice size, read-ahead length)."],[2026,"**Deep Learning Training**: Provides high-speed data access for deep learning training, significantly reducing data loading time, improving GPU utilization, and accelerating model training processes"],[2149,"**Default config**: `conf/curvine-cluster.toml` (relative to current working directory when the process starts)"],[2148,"**Default mount path**: `/curvine-fuse`"],[1633,"**Dependencies**"],[3334,"**Directory Count**: Shows the number of directories in the file system"],[3345,"**Directory Item Count**: Displays the number of files and subdirectories in the current directory"],[3343,"**Directory Operations**: Supports creating new directories, deleting directories, and other operations"],[1524,"**Docker:** `make docker-build` — Build **runtime** image from source. `make docker-build-compile` — Build compilation image (interactive). `make docker-compile` — Compile in container, output to local `build/dist`."],[5110,"**Docker**：`make docker-build` — 构建**运行时**镜像；`make docker-build-compile` — 构建编译用镜像（交互）；`make docker-compile` — 在容器内编译，输出到本地 `build/dist`"],[1539,"**Dockerfile_amzn2** — Amazon Linux 2"],[5125,"**Dockerfile_amzn2** — Amazon Linux 2"],[1536,"**Dockerfile_rocky9_cached** — Rocky 9 with dependency cache (faster rebuilds)"],[5122,"**Dockerfile_rocky9_cached** — Rocky 9，带依赖缓存（重编更快）"],[1535,"**Dockerfile_rocky9** — Rocky Linux 9 (recommended baseline)"],[5121,"**Dockerfile_rocky9** — Rocky Linux 9（推荐基线）"],[1537,"**Dockerfile_ubuntu22** — Ubuntu 22.04"],[5123,"**Dockerfile_ubuntu22** — Ubuntu 22.04"],[1538,"**Dockerfile_ubuntu24** — Ubuntu 24.04"],[5124,"**Dockerfile_ubuntu24** — Ubuntu 24.04"],[374,"**Drain**: On shutdown, `drain_all()` frees all cached qpairs."],[3962,"**Drain**：关闭时，`drain_all()` 会释放所有缓存 qpair。"],[1521,"**Environment:** `make check-env` — Check build dependencies (also run automatically by `make build`)."],[379,"**eventfd**: File descriptor for waking the poller from Idle state"],[3967,"**eventfd**：用于从 Idle 状态唤醒 poller 的文件描述符"],[2277,"**Example configuration:**"],[1526,"**Example:** `RELEASE_VERSION=v1.0.0 make dist` — Build and package with a version tag."],[239,"**Excessive latency**: external databases require network communication to complete reads and writes. Each metadata operation has to go through an additional network round trip, and tail latency increases significantly. This is far slower than local operations using memory and local RocksDB and cannot meet the low-latency requirements of high-frequency small operations."],[276,"**Extensibility**: Easy addition of new storage backend support"],[181,"**Failover**: When the leader dies, Raft elects a new leader; the new leader continues applying the journal and serving metadata. Standby nodes that catch up via log replay or snapshot become eligible for leadership."],[3363,"**Fault Detection**: Helps administrators quickly identify problematic nodes"],[3342,"**File Details**: Shows file size, modification time, permissions, and other attribute information"],[3341,"**File List View**: Displays files and subdirectories in the current directory in list format"],[3344,"**File Operations**: Supports basic file operations such as viewing, downloading, and deleting files"],[347,"**Fixed-size byte buffers**: SPDK C structs (async context, namespace data) are represented as `[u8; N]` with `#[repr(C, align(8))]` instead of matching the C layout field-by-field. This avoids version-dependent layout mismatches."],[3372,"**format_master**: Master node formatting status"],[6965,"**format_master**：Master节点格式化状态"],[3373,"**format_worker**: Worker node formatting status"],[6966,"**format_worker**：Worker节点格式化状态"],[1967,"**FsDir + InodeStore**: In-memory inode tree and metadata management"],[5562,"**FsDir + InodeStore**：内存中的 inode 树和元数据管理"],[1960,"**FsReader / FsWriter**: Parallel, buffered I/O with zero-copy optimization"],[5555,"**FsReader / FsWriter**：并行、缓冲的 I/O，具有零拷贝优化"],[913,"**FUSE (optional):** Start `curvine-fuse` only when you need a POSIX filesystem mount (e.g. for legacy tools or scripts). FUSE is not a core service—the cluster does not depend on it to start or run."],[1742,"**FUSE Interface**: Provides POSIX file system interface, mounting distributed cache as local file system"],[2143,"**FUSE is an optional access method.** The Curvine cluster (Master + Worker) must be running first. FUSE is only needed when applications require a POSIX mount point. See Deployment Architecture for the role of each component."],[915,"**FUSE is not part of cluster startup.** The Curvine cluster is formed by Master and Worker nodes. FUSE is one of several access methods (along with CLI and SDK) and is only needed when applications require a local mount point."],[1954,"**FUSE Mount**: POSIX-compatible mount via libfuse/3 (curvine-fuse)"],[4502,"**FUSE 不参与集群启动。** Curvine 集群由 Master 与 Worker 组成。FUSE 与 CLI、SDK 一样，只是多种访问方式之一，仅在应用需要本地挂载点时才有必要启用。"],[5549,"**FUSE 挂载**：通过 libfuse/3 的 POSIX 兼容挂载 (curvine-fuse)"],[5737,"**FUSE 是可选接入方式。** 须先启动 Curvine 集群（Master + Worker），FUSE 仅在应用需要 POSIX 挂载点时使用。各组件角色见 部署架构。"],[4500,"**FUSE（可选）：** 仅当需要 POSIX 文件系统挂载（如兼容旧工具、脚本）时再启动 `curvine-fuse`。FUSE 不是核心服务，集群的启动与运行不依赖它。"],[1639,"**FUSE**: libfuse2 or libfuse3 development packages"],[1835,"**FUSE**: libfuse2 or libfuse3 development packages"],[5227,"​**FUSE**: libfuse2 or libfuse3 development packages"],[5430,"**FUSE**：libfuse2 或 libfuse3 开发包"],[5337,"**FUSE接口**：提供POSIX文件系统接口，将分布式缓存挂载为本地文件系统"],[1634,"**GCC**: version 10 or later (GCC Installation)"],[5222,"​**GCC**: version 10 or later (GCC Installation)"],[1830,"**GCC**: version 10 or later (Installation Guide)"],[5425,"**GCC**：10 或更高版本（安装指南）"],[4486,"**GitHub 上统一用英文。** Issue、PR、Review 评论以及 skill 本身都用英文书写，方便社区里的每个人跟进。"],[283,"**Google Cloud Storage**: Google cloud storage, supports `gcs://` and `gs://` protocols"],[3871,"**Google Cloud Storage**：Google 云存储，支持 `gcs://` 和 `gs://` 协议"],[3346,"**Grid View Button**: Provides grid view toggle option for different browsing needs"],[6939,"**Grid View按钮**：提供网格视图切换选项，方便不同的浏览需求"],[302,"**Hadoop Environment** (version should match target HDFS cluster version):"],[3890,"**Hadoop 环境**（版本需与目标 HDFS 集群版本一致）："],[1982,"**HDD**: Capacity tier (< 10 ms)"],[5577,"**HDD**：容量层（< 10 ms）"],[1955,"**HDFS & SDK**: Java / Python / libsdk interfaces"],[5550,"**HDFS & SDK**：Java / Python / libsdk 接口"],[2020,"**HDFS ecosystem compatibility**: Offers Hadoop FileSystem integration and SDK access paths"],[1988,"**HDFS**"],[5583,"**HDFS**"],[284,"**HDFS**: Hadoop Distributed File System, supports `hdfs://` protocol (requires special environment setup)"],[3872,"**HDFS**：Hadoop 分布式文件系统，支持 `hdfs://` 协议（需要特殊环境配置）"],[241,"**High and cumbersome O&M cost**: introducing an external database adds dependent components to the cluster. This database needs to be deployed, monitored, and maintained separately, and fault recovery becomes more complex. At the same time, as the amount of metadata grows, the cost of an externally hosted database increases significantly, which does not meet the goal of controllable cost."],[275,"**High Performance**: Optimized data access paths and caching mechanisms"],[2021,"**High performance**: Uses asynchronous I/O and zero-copy-oriented data paths for low-latency, high-throughput workloads"],[3473,"**High-concurrency small files (> 1000 concurrent):**"],[7066,"**High-concurrency small files (> 1000 concurrent):**"],[1998,"**High-Performance RPC Framework**: Curvine implements a custom RPC communication framework supporting efficient data transmission with asynchronous I/O and zero-copy implementation within the framework"],[384,"**Hugepage backing**: Allocated via `curvine_spdk_dma_malloc` which returns physically contiguous, pinned memory. This satisfies the NVMe controller's DMA requirements and avoids TLB misses for large I/Os."],[3972,"**Hugepage 支持**：通过 `curvine_spdk_dma_malloc` 分配，返回物理连续且固定的内存，满足 NVMe controller 的 DMA 要求，并减少大 I/O 中的 TLB miss。"],[414,"**I/O submission and polling**: Experiment with batch submission and multi-poller approaches to scale throughput."],[4002,"**I/O 提交与轮询**：尝试批量提交和多 poller 方案，以扩展吞吐能力。"],[246,"**Idempotent retry guarantee**: synchronization operations adopt an idempotent design. Repeated execution of the same modification operation will not change the result, avoiding exceptions such as duplicate file creation or duplicate deletion and ensuring the reliability of the synchronization process."],[351,"**Idle**: The poller blocks on `eventfd` to avoid burning CPU. Handler threads signal the `eventfd` when enqueuing a new request, waking the poller into Active."],[3939,"**Idle**：poller 阻塞在 `eventfd` 上，避免空转消耗 CPU。handler 线程在入队新请求时会通知 `eventfd`，将 poller 唤醒到 Active 状态。"],[877,"**If you are reviewing**, run:"],[879,"**If you are the author responding to feedback**, run:"],[224,"**In-memory directory tree**: focuses on the ultimate speed of high-frequency operations. It only stores the most core directory structure information, such as folder names, parent folder IDs, and child node lists, and does not store detailed file attributes such as size and modification time. This design keeps memory usage extremely low and allows high-frequency operations such as directory listing and path lookup to be completed directly in memory with very fast response."],[1977,"**IO Handlers**: Read / Write pipeline with zero-copy"],[5572,"**IO Handlers**：读/写管道，具有零拷贝"],[358,"**IoCompletion**: Bridges handler and poller threads. The handler blocks on `wait(timeout)`; the poller's C callback wakes it via `complete(status)`."],[3946,"**IoCompletion**：连接 handler 和 poller 线程。handler 在 `wait(timeout)` 上阻塞；poller 的 C 回调通过 `complete(status)` 唤醒它。"],[356,"**IoOp**: The operation enum. `Read` and `Write` carry namespace, qpair, DMA buffer, offset, and length. `Flush` targets a namespace; `UnregisterQpair` notifies cleanup."],[3944,"**IoOp**：操作枚举。`Read` 和 `Write` 携带 namespace、qpair、DMA buffer、offset 和 length；`Flush` 作用于 namespace；`UnregisterQpair` 用于通知清理。"],[357,"**IoRequest**: The envelope wrapping an `IoOp`, `Arc<IoCompletion>`, and the per-bdev inflight counter. Sent through the crossbeam channel."],[3945,"**IoRequest**：封装 `IoOp`、`Arc<IoCompletion>` 以及每个 bdev 的 inflight 计数器，通过 crossbeam channel 发送。"],[3355,"**IP Address**: Network address of the worker node"],[6948,"**IP地址**：工作节点的网络地址"],[1685,"**Issue 1: Insufficient permissions**"],[1661,"**Issue 1: protoc command not found**"],[1673,"**Issue 2: macFUSE not properly installed**"],[1656,"**Issue 2: Maven command not found**"],[1662,"**Issue 2: Maven command not found**"],[1686,"**Issue 2: Node.js version too low**"],[1687,"**Issue 3: Java environment issues**"],[1674,"**Issue 3: Java version issues**"],[1657,"**Issue 3: Rust-related commands not found**"],[1663,"**Issue 3: Rust-related commands not found**"],[1688,"**Issue 4: FUSE module not loaded**"],[1658,"**Issue 4: GCC version too low (< 10.0)**"],[1664,"**Issue 4: GCC version too low (< 10.0)**"],[1675,"**Issue 4: GCC version**"],[1689,"**Issue 5: GCC version too low (< 10.0)**"],[1676,"**Issue 5: Python version issues**"],[1659,"**Issue 5: Python version too low (< 3.7)**"],[1660,"**Issue 6: pip installation failed or version too old**"],[1677,"**Issue 6: pip related issues**"],[1690,"**Issue 6: Python version too low (< 3.7)**"],[1691,"**Issue 7: pip related issues**"],[301,"**Java Environment** (JDK 8 or above):"],[3889,"**Java 环境**（JDK 8 及以上版本）："],[1640,"**JDK**: version 1.8 or later (OpenJDK or Oracle JDK)"],[1836,"**JDK**: version 1.8 or later (OpenJDK or Oracle JDK)"],[5228,"​**JDK**: version 1.8 or later (OpenJDK or Oracle JDK)"],[5431,"**JDK**：1.8 或更高版本（OpenJDK 或 Oracle JDK）"],[174,"**Journal**: Every metadata change is persisted as a **journal entry** (e.g. `Mkdir`, `CreateFile`, `AddBlock`, `CompleteFile`, `Rename`, `Delete`, `Mount`, `UnMount`). The leader appends entries to the Raft log; once committed, they are applied to the in-memory metadata tree (`FsDir`)."],[1968,"**JournalSystem**: Edit log and snapshot for recovery"],[5563,"**JournalSystem**：编辑日志和快照以进行恢复"],[899,"**Keep GitHub English.** Issues, PRs, review comments, and skills themselves are written in English so everyone in the community can follow along."],[3558,"**Kernel parameter optimization**: Adjust network buffers, resource limits, and other parameters"],[2027,"**Large Language Model Inference**: Optimizes data access for LLM inference scenarios, reducing inference latency and improving model service response speed and throughput"],[3356,"**Last Heartbeat Time**: Shows the last communication time between the node and Master"],[242,"**Limited optimization space**: external databases are general-purpose designs and cannot be customized for characteristics such as high-frequency directory operations and batch reads/writes of metadata. A self-developed architecture can deeply optimize core processes such as path resolution and on-demand loading, making it better suited to business requirements."],[1638,"**LLVM**: version 12 or later (Installation Guide)"],[1834,"**LLVM**: version 12 or later (Installation Guide)"],[5226,"​**LLVM**: version 12 or later (Installation Guide)"],[5429,"**LLVM**：12 或更高版本（安装指南）"],[1989,"**Local FS**"],[5584,"**Local FS**"],[229,"**Log replay ensures consistency**: the Leader node in the cluster is responsible for initiating modification operations and recording logs. Follower nodes synchronize the Leader's logs in real time and execute the same modification operations one by one in log order, ensuring that the metadata state of all nodes is completely consistent and avoiding data divergence."],[228,"**Log synchronization first**: any metadata modification operation, such as creation, deletion, rename, or attribute modification, is first packaged as an operation log and stored in a dedicated log database, then synchronized to more than half of the machines in the cluster. Only after most machines successfully receive and store this log is the modification operation officially effective, ensuring that data will not be lost due to a single machine failure."],[2334,"**Master address**: Set `client.master_addrs` in the cluster config (e.g. `curvine-cluster.toml`) or pass the equivalent in each SDK (Java: `fs.cv.master_addrs`, Spark: `spark.hadoop.fs.cv.master_addrs`). Format: `host1:8995,host2:8995`."],[3323,"**Master Node Address**: Shows the access address and port of the Master node"],[1731,"**Master nodes** (can be multiple for high availability): Responsible for metadata management, worker node coordination, and load balancing"],[5930,"**Master 地址**：在集群配置（如 `curvine-cluster.toml`）中设置 `client.master_addrs`，或在各 SDK 中传入等价配置（如 Java 的 `fs.cv.master_addrs`）。格式：`host1:8995,host2:8995`。"],[5326,"**Master 节点**（可多节点部署以实现高可用）：负责元数据管理、Worker 协调与负载均衡"],[3376,"**master_hostname**: Hostname of the Master node"],[6969,"**master_hostname**：Master节点的主机名"],[3382,"**master_io_close_idle**: Idle connection closure configuration for the Master node"],[6975,"**master_io_close_idle**：Master节点空闲连接关闭配置"],[3379,"**master_io_threads**: Number of IO threads for the Master node"],[6972,"**master_io_threads**：Master节点IO线程数"],[3381,"**master_io_timeout**: IO timeout for the Master node"],[6974,"**master_io_timeout**：Master节点IO超时时间"],[3385,"**master_meta_compression_type**: Metadata compression type"],[6978,"**master_meta_compression_type**：元数据压缩类型"],[3383,"**master_meta_dir**: Metadata storage directory for the Master node"],[6976,"**master_meta_dir**：Master节点元数据存储目录"],[3384,"**master_meta_disable_wal**: Metadata WAL logging switch"],[6977,"**master_meta_disable_wal**：元数据WAL日志开关"],[3377,"**master_rpc_port**: RPC service port of the Master node"],[6970,"**master_rpc_port**：Master节点RPC服务端口"],[3378,"**master_web_port**: Web service port of the Master node"],[6971,"**master_web_port**：Master节点Web服务端口"],[3380,"**master_worker_threads**: Number of worker threads for the Master node"],[6973,"**master_worker_threads**：Master节点工作线程数"],[1963,"**Master**: The core control node; responsible for metadata (directory tree, file inodes, block locations), Worker registration, block allocation, and UFS mount table. Master can run as multiple nodes forming a Raft group for high availability; only the Raft leader serves metadata writes."],[5558,"**Master**：核心控制节点；负责元数据（目录树、文件 inode、块位置）、Worker 注册、块分配和 UFS 挂载表。Master 可以作为多个节点运行，形成 Raft 组以实现高可用性；只有 Raft Leader 处理元数据写入。"],[1966,"**MasterFilesystem**: File system operations (mkdir, create, rename, delete, list)"],[5561,"**MasterFilesystem**：文件系统操作（mkdir、create、rename、delete、list）"],[1965,"**MasterServer**: RPC handling and routing"],[5560,"**MasterServer**：RPC 处理和路由"],[1637,"**Maven**: version 3.8 or later (Install Guide)"],[1833,"**Maven**: version 3.8 or later (Install Guide)"],[5225,"​**Maven**: version 3.8 or later (Install Guide)"],[5428,"**Maven**：3.8 或更高版本（安装指南）"],[1980,"**MEM**: In-memory tier (< 100 ns)"],[5575,"**MEM**：内存层（< 100 ns）"],[244,"**Metadata mirror synchronization**: all metadata modifications in Curvine, such as creation, deletion, and attribute modification, are asynchronously synchronized to UFS in the background after being completed locally. This ensures that the directory structure and file attributes of Curvine and UFS are completely consistent, implementing a unified namespace."],[190,"**Metadata**: The client asks the Master for file metadata and **block locations** (which Worker(s) hold which block IDs, offsets, lengths). The Master returns `FileBlocks` (file status + list of block locations)."],[1994,"**Metrics**: Prometheus-based monitoring (master/worker/client, job, cache)"],[5589,"**Metrics**：基于 Prometheus 的监控（master/worker/client、job、cache）"],[1962,"**Mount & Meta Cache**: Caches mount info and inode metadata"],[5557,"**Mount & Meta Cache**：缓存挂载信息和 inode 元数据"],[2031,"**Multi-cloud Data Caching**: Improves data access efficiency across clouds and regions"],[2016,"**Multi-cloud storage support**: Works with S3-compatible systems, HDFS, OSS, MinIO, and other UFS backends through a unified access layer"],[2005,"**Multi-Replica Mechanism**: Multi-replica mechanism ensures data redundancy backup, improving system reliability and fault tolerance"],[274,"**Multi-Storage Support**: Support for object storage, filesystems, databases, and more"],[2018,"**Multi-tier cache**: Supports memory, SSD, and HDD cache strategies"],[2941,"**Native Rust CLI `cv`**: the recommended entry point, with the full command tree from `curvine-cli`."],[3339,"**Navigate Button**: Provides a \"Navigate\" button for path jumping"],[3467,"**Never rename large directories** on S3/OSS backends — it triggers full data copy."],[7060,"**Never rename large directories** on S3/OSS backends — it triggers full data copy."],[3357,"**Node Capacity Information**:"],[3354,"**Node ID**: Unique identifier for the worker node"],[3364,"**Node Recovery Status**: Tracks the recovery status of offline nodes"],[3328,"**Node Status Indicators**: Visual display of node health status through color coding"],[303,"**Note**: Ensure all Worker nodes have the correct Java and Hadoop environment variables configured, otherwise HDFS mount and load operations will fail."],[1641,"**npm**: version 9 or later (Node.js Installation)"],[1837,"**npm**: version 9 or later (Node.js Installation)"],[5432,"**npm**：9 或更高版本（Node.js 安装）"],[5229,"**npm**：版本 9 及以上（Node.js 安装）"],[3362,"**Offline Node List**: Displays currently offline or unresponsive worker nodes"],[3327,"**Offline Worker Count**: Shows currently offline or failed Worker nodes"],[251,"**One fallback**: through fs-mode cooperation with UFS, metadata and file data have dual backups, ensuring data safety while supporting fast fault recovery."],[250,"**One trade-off**: the Leader-first write strategy uses an extremely short consistency window in exchange for low latency and high throughput in high-concurrency scenarios, adapting to the core scenario of massive small-file reads and writes."],[346,"**Opaque ZST pointers**: SPDK types like `spdk_nvme_ctrlr` are declared as zero-sized enums in Rust — they exist only for compile-time type safety. At runtime they are raw pointers passed straight to C."],[1990,"**OpenDAL (Azure, GCS, etc.)**"],[5585,"**OpenDAL (Azure, GCS, etc.)**"],[1530,"**Option A — Compile in container, output to local `build/dist`:**"],[1532,"**Option B — Persistent development container:**"],[1992,"**orpc**: High-performance RPC framework (Tokio-based, zero-copy)"],[5587,"**orpc**：高性能 RPC 框架（基于 Tokio，零拷贝）"],[353,"**Orphaned (HashMap)**: When `curvine_spdk_qpair_poll` returns an error, the qpair is moved from Active into an `orphaned` HashMap. The poller force-completes all pending I/Os on the failed qpair via `force_complete_qpair`, waking blocked handler threads with an error status. The orphaned entry persists to catch late SPDK callbacks."],[3941,"**Orphaned（HashMap）**：当 `curvine_spdk_qpair_poll` 返回错误时，对应 qpair 会从 Active 转入 `orphaned` HashMap。poller 会通过 `force_complete_qpair` 强制完成该 qpair 上所有挂起 I/O，并用错误状态唤醒阻塞的 handler 线程。orphaned 记录会保留，用来接住后续迟到的 SPDK 回调。"],[1987,"**OSS**"],[5582,"**OSS**"],[1523,"**Partial builds:** `make build ARGS='-p core'` (server+client+cli), `make build ARGS='-p core -p fuse'`, `make build ARGS='-p web'`, `make build ARGS='-d'` (debug). Use `make build-hdfs` for HDFS support (native + WebHDFS); `make build ARGS='--skip-java-sdk'` to skip Java SDK."],[3338,"**Path Navigation Bar**: Displays the current file system path with support for quick navigation"],[3388,"**Performance Tuning Reference**: Evaluate performance optimization opportunities based on current configuration"],[380,"**poller_is_sleeping**: Shared `AtomicBool` set true by the poller when idle; bdevs check it to skip the eventfd write syscall"],[3968,"**poller_is_sleeping**：由 poller 在 idle 时置为 true 的共享 `AtomicBool`；bdev 会检查它，从而跳过不必要的 eventfd write 系统调用"],[378,"**poller_tx**: Crossbeam sender to submit `IoRequest`s to the poller thread"],[3966,"**poller_tx**：用于向 poller 线程提交 `IoRequest` 的 crossbeam sender"],[2943,"**POSIX / FUSE**: after mounting with FUSE, use standard Linux commands directly on the mount point."],[6537,"**POSIX / FUSE**：通过 FUSE 挂载后，直接在挂载点使用标准 Linux 命令。"],[5614,"**POSIX 兼容访问**：通过 FUSE 将缓存数据以本地文件系统方式暴露给现有应用"],[2019,"**POSIX-compatible access**: Provides a FUSE layer so existing applications can access cached data as a local file system"],[385,"**Pre-allocated and reused**: Each `SpdkBdev` allocates two buffers (read + write) at open time via `curvine_spdk_dma_malloc` and reuses them for every I/O. This avoids a malloc/free cycle per I/O — the buffer is zero-cost after the first allocation."],[3218,"**Pre-release vs release bounds.** Pre-release versions sort before the\ncorresponding release version (`0.4.0-alpha < 0.4.0`). If\n`min_worker_version = \"0.4.0\"` is configured, a pre-release worker is rejected\nbecause it sorts below the bound. To allow pre-releases, lower the minimum\nbound accordingly."],[247,"**Progress tracking and fast recovery**: the system separately records the latest Curvine local modification progress and UFS synchronization progress. If UFS falls too far behind due to failure or network disconnection, after recovery it does not need to resynchronize all data. It only needs to continue synchronization from the last interrupted progress, greatly improving recovery efficiency."],[240,"**Prone to performance bottlenecks**: metadata operations are mostly high-frequency small requests. When massive clients connect to an external database at the same time, it is easy to exhaust database connections, causing QPS to hit a ceiling and making it unable to support high-concurrency scenarios."],[1832,"**Protobuf**: version 3.x"],[1636,"**Protobuf**: version 3.x+ (Install Guide)"],[5224,"​**Protobuf**: version 3.x+ (Install Guide)"],[5427,"**Protobuf**：3.x 版本"],[1997,"**Pure Rust Implementation**: Curvine is implemented entirely in Rust, avoiding performance bottlenecks and resource consumption of traditional languages while ensuring code safety and stability"],[1642,"**Python**: version 3.7 or later"],[5230,"**Python**: version 3.7 or later"],[1838,"**Python**: version 3.7 or later (Installation Guide)"],[5433,"**Python**：3.7 或更高版本（安装指南）"],[377,"**qpair**: The NVMe queue pair for issuing commands"],[3965,"**qpair**：用于发起命令的 NVMe queue pair"],[1970,"**Quota / Job / Replication**: Quota control, TTL, eviction, replication scheduling"],[5565,"**Quota / Job / Replication**：配额控制、TTL、驱逐、复制调度"],[1972,"**Raft Consensus**: Leader election and log replication"],[5567,"**Raft Consensus**：Leader 选举和日志复制"],[2003,"**Raft Protocol**: Uses Raft protocol to implement distributed consistency, ensuring data consistency and reliability"],[5617,"**Raft 元数据高可用**：通过 Raft 保证 Master 元数据一致性"],[2022,"**Raft-based metadata HA**: Uses Raft to keep metadata consistent across Master nodes"],[5598,"**Raft协议**：使用用 Raft 协议实现分布式一致性，保证数据的一致性和可靠性。"],[3474,"**Random read:**"],[7067,"**Random read:**"],[186,"**Read path**: The Worker’s `ReadHandler` receives block-read RPCs, opens the block file, and returns data (with optional read-ahead and sendfile-style optimizations)."],[373,"**Release**: Push the qpair back into the pool. If the pool exceeds the limit (16 per controller by default), free the excess via `curvine_spdk_free_io_qpair` to bound controller-side memory."],[3961,"**Release**：将 qpair 放回池中。如果池超过上限（默认每个 controller 16 个），则通过 `curvine_spdk_free_io_qpair` 释放多余 qpair，以限制 controller 侧内存占用。"],[277,"**Reliability**: Built-in retry mechanisms and error handling"],[177,"**Replay**: `JournalLoader` applies each committed `JournalEntry` to the local `FsDir` (e.g. `mkdir`, `create_file`, `add_block`, `complete_file`, `rename`, `delete`, `mount`, `unmount`). This keeps standby state identical to the leader."],[1978,"**Replication / Tasks**: Background replication and task scheduling"],[5573,"**Replication / Tasks**：后台复制和任务调度"],[387,"**Reuse through chunking**: Large I/Os are split into `dma_buf_size` chunks and processed serially through the same fixed buffer, avoiding the need for dynamically-sized DMA memory."],[1971,"**RocksDB Metadata Store**: Persistent metadata storage"],[5566,"**RocksDB Metadata Store**：持久元数据存储"],[225,"**RocksDB**: focuses on reliable storage of massive data and carries the complete detailed information of all files and directories, including file size, permissions, modification time, and the location of data blocks on disk. By classifying and managing different types of metadata through column families, data organization becomes clearer. At the same time, RocksDB's high-concurrency read/write characteristics ensure the read/write efficiency of massive metadata."],[3813,"**RocksDB**：聚焦海量数据的可靠存储，承载所有文件/目录的完整详细信息，包括文件大小、权限、修改时间、数据块在磁盘中的位置等。通过列族分类管理不同类型的元数据，让数据组织更清晰，同时利用自身高并发读写特性，确保海量元数据的读写效率。"],[180,"**Role detection**: `MasterMonitor` exposes whether the current node is active: `is_active()` is true only when the Raft role is **Leader**. The client or upper layer should route metadata write requests to the current leader (e.g. by resolving the leader from the cluster config or a router)."],[176,"**Role**: Raft followers do **not** serve metadata write RPC. They receive committed log entries from the leader and **replay** them to keep a copy of the metadata."],[173,"**Role**: The Raft leader is the only node that accepts metadata-mutating RPC (create file, add block, rename, delete, mount/umount, etc.)."],[1635,"**Rust**: version 1.98 (pinned by `rust-toolchain.toml`; `build/check-env.sh` accepts 1.86 or later) (Installation Guide)"],[1831,"**Rust**: version 1.98 (pinned by `rust-toolchain.toml`; `build/check-env.sh` accepts 1.86 or later) (Installation Guide)"],[5223,"**Rust**：1.98（由 `rust-toolchain.toml` 固定；`build/check-env.sh` 接受 1.86 及以上） (Installation Guide)"],[5426,"**Rust**：1.98（由 `rust-toolchain.toml` 固定；`build/check-env.sh` 接受 1.86 及以上）（安装指南）"],[1986,"**S3 / MinIO**"],[5581,"**S3 / MinIO**"],[252,"**Selection advantage**: by giving up external databases and adopting a local architecture, Curvine reduces latency and O&M costs while retaining room for customized optimization, perfectly matching the core requirements of a distributed file system."],[3472,"**Sequential read (large files > 100GB):**"],[7065,"**Sequential read (large files > 100GB):**"],[2030,"**Shuffle Data Storage**: Stores intermediate results (shuffle) during big data computation, achieving complete separation of compute and storage"],[4488,"**Skill 和代码一起维护。** 想改进某个 skill，请遵循 `cv-add-skills`，并同步更新 `AGENTS.md` 中的注册表。"],[901,"**Skills live with the code.** If you want to improve one, follow `cv-add-skills` and keep the registry in `AGENTS.md` up to date."],[234,"**Small cost**: an extremely short consistency window. If the Leader node fails just after completing the local modification but before synchronizing the log, these unsynchronized modifications may not be synchronized to other nodes. However, this window is extremely short, usually only a few milliseconds, and the probability of occurrence in actual production is extremely low. It is an acceptable trade-off between performance and consistency."],[2006,"**Snapshot Mechanism**: Lightweight snapshot mechanism for periodic data backup, improving system recovery speed and stability"],[178,"**Snapshot**: The system supports Raft snapshots; when a snapshot exists, the metadata can be restored from it instead of replaying from the beginning."],[230,"**Snapshots accelerate recovery**: if a machine falls too far behind the Leader due to failure or network disconnection, it does not need to replay all historical logs one by one. The Leader directly sends a complete snapshot of the current data. After loading the snapshot, the machine can quickly catch up with the cluster progress, greatly shortening fault recovery time and improving system availability."],[1983,"**SPDK**: User-space NVMe acceleration"],[5578,"**SPDK**：用户空间 NVMe 加速"],[1981,"**SSD**: NVMe / SATA (< 100 µs)"],[5576,"**SSD**：NVMe / SATA（< 100 µs）"],[3325,"**Startup Time**: Shows the cluster startup timestamp"],[179,"**Storage**: Metadata log and Raft state use **RocksDB** (`RocksLogStorage`). The journal is the application payload carried in Raft log entries."],[2146,"**Supported systems**: FUSE 2 and FUSE 3 are supported; behavior may vary by distribution. See Supported Linux Distributions."],[4000,"**Target 侧混合模式**：将 active/idle 状态切换应用到 SPDK NVMe-oF target，在空闲时降低 CPU 使用率。"],[412,"**Target-side hybrid mode**: Apply active/idle state transitions to the SPDK NVMe-oF target to reduce CPU usage when idle."],[281,"**Tencent Cloud COS**: Tencent Cloud object storage, supports `cos://` protocol"],[3374,"**testing**: Test mode switch status"],[6967,"**testing**：测试模式开关状态"],[3557,"**Thread count tuning**: Adjust the number of worker threads based on CPU cores and business load"],[249,"**Three-layer division of responsibilities**: the in-memory directory tree handles speed, with high-frequency operations responding instantly; RocksDB handles storage, reliably carrying massive metadata; the Raft protocol handles consistency, keeping multi-node data free of divergence. The three work together to achieve fast, stable, efficient, and complete behavior."],[198,"**Through**: Data is written only to UFS; cache is bypassed."],[3786,"**Through**：仅写 UFS，绕过缓存。"],[872,"**Title:** `<type>(<module>): <description> (#<issueNumber>)`"],[3350,"**Total Capacity Display**: Shows the total storage capacity of all worker nodes"],[3333,"**Total File Count**: Displays the total number of files in the file system"],[3329,"**Total Storage Capacity**: Displays the total storage capacity of the cluster"],[1743,"**Transfer Service (optional)**: Runs Load and Export jobs outside the Master process; see Transfer Service."],[5338,"**Transfer 服务（可选）**：在 Master 进程之外运行 Load 与 Export 任务，参见 Transfer 服务。"],[3389,"**Troubleshooting Support**: Quickly check relevant configurations when issues arise"],[1730,"**UFS Cluster**: As the underlying storage backend, connected to the Curvine cluster through mounting, such as S3, HDFS, and other clusters."],[1984,"**UFS**: Underlying storage (S3, HDFS, etc.) accessed through Curvine’s data orchestration; Curvine provides a unified file system view over mounted UFS paths and native paths."],[5579,"**UFS**：底层存储（S3、HDFS 等）通过 Curvine 的数据编排访问；Curvine 在挂载的 UFS 路径和原生路径上提供统一文件系统视图。"],[273,"**Unified Interface**: Consistent APIs across different storage backends"],[1959,"**UnifiedFileSystem**: Provides unified namespace with CurvineFS + UFS fallback"],[5554,"**UnifiedFileSystem**：提供 CurvineFS + UFS 回退的统一命名空间"],[3361,"**Usage Rate Indicator**: Visual display of node storage usage rate through progress bars"],[3102,"**Usage:** `cv admin config <set|get|reset> ...`"],[3095,"**Usage:** `cv bench [OPTIONS]` and `cv bench prefill [OPTIONS]`"],[3067,"**Usage:** `cv cancel-load [OPTIONS] <JOB_ID>`"],[3054,"**Usage:** `cv export [OPTIONS] <PATH>`"],[2976,"**Usage:** `cv fs [OPTIONS] <COMMAND> [ARGS]`"],[3097,"**Usage:** `cv fsck <PATH> [OPTIONS]`"],[3043,"**Usage:** `cv load [OPTIONS] <SOURCE_PATH> [TARGET_PATH]`"],[3071,"**Usage:** `cv load-list [OPTIONS]`"],[3060,"**Usage:** `cv load-status [OPTIONS] <JOB_ID>`"],[2964,"**Usage:** `cv node [OPTIONS] [-- <NODES>...]`"],[2955,"**Usage:** `cv report [json|all|capacity|used|available]`"],[3041,"**Usage:** `cv umount <CURVINE_PATH>`"],[3091,"**Usage:** `cv version`"],[3330,"**Used Storage Space**: Shows currently used storage space"],[3387,"**Verify Configuration Correctness**: Confirm that configuration parameters meet expectations"],[3324,"**Version Information**: Displays the current running Curvine version number"],[3465,"**Warning**: `delete` in cache_mode deletes UFS data. Use `free` for cache-only cleanup."],[7058,"**Warning**: `delete` in cache_mode deletes UFS data. Use `free` for cache-only cleanup."],[2024,"**Web management interface**: Provides browser-based status and management pages on service web ports"],[5619,"**Web 管理界面**：在服务 Web 端口提供浏览器管理与状态查看能力"],[1969,"**Worker / Mount Manager**: Worker heartbeat and UFS mount management"],[5564,"**Worker / Mount Manager**：Worker 心跳和 UFS 挂载管理"],[1737,"**Worker Node**: Responsible for data storage and processing"],[1973,"**Worker**: Stores block data and serves block read/write RPC; reports to Master via heartbeat. Does not hold file system metadata."],[5568,"**Worker**：存储块数据并服务块读写 RPC；通过心跳向 Master 上报。不保存文件系统元数据。"],[1975,"**WorkerServer**: Handles block I/O RPC and heartbeat"],[5570,"**WorkerServer**：处理块 I/O RPC 和心跳"],[5332,"**Worker节点**：负责数据存储和处理"],[195,"**Write data**: The client sends block data to the assigned Worker(s) via block-write RPC. The Worker persists data to its BlockStore."],[187,"**Write path**: The Worker’s write handlers accept block write RPCs, write data to the block store, and finalize or abort blocks as requested by the client/Master."],[196,"**Write types** (for UFS-mounted paths, see Data Orchestration — Mount Modes):"],[897,"**You own the change.** Skills are assistants. Read every diff, run the tests, and be ready to explain the change. Your name is on the commit."],[2001,"**Zero-Copy**: Zero-copy design avoids data copying and memory allocation, reducing system memory usage and resource consumption"],[1999,"**Zero-Cost Abstractions**: Zero-cost abstraction design where core modules directly interface with underlying systems, avoiding unnecessary abstraction layers and improving system performance and resource utilization"],[3839,"**一个兜底**：通过 fs-mode 模式与 UFS 协同，实现元数据和文件数据的双重备份，保障数据安全，同时支持快速故障恢复；"],[3838,"**一个权衡**：采用 Leader 优先写策略，以极短的一致性窗口，换取高并发场景下的低延迟和高吞吐量，适配大量小文件读写的核心场景；"],[3837,"**三层分工**：内存目录树管速度（高频操作秒响应），RocksDB 管存储（海量元数据稳承载），Raft 协议管一致（多节点数据无偏差），三者协同，实现“快而稳、省而全”；"],[3934,"**不透明 ZST 指针**：`spdk_nvme_ctrlr` 等 SPDK 类型在 Rust 中声明为零大小 enum，仅用于编译期类型安全；运行时仍是直接传给 C 的原始指针。"],[5623,"**为分析型数据库和OLAP引擎提供高速缓存，显著提升复杂查询性能，减少数据分析时间。**"],[5624,"**为大数据计算场景提供高速缓存，降低数据读写时间。**"],[5621,"**为深度学习训练提供高速数据访问，大幅减少数据加载时间，提高GPU利用率，加速模型训练进程。**"],[6916,"**主节点地址**：显示Master节点的访问地址和端口"],[5612,"**云原生集成**：支持 CSI 与 Kubernetes 部署场景"],[3830,"**优化空间有限**：外部数据库是通用型设计，无法针对元数据的高频目录操作、批量读写等特点做定制化优化，而自研架构可深度优化路径解析、按需加载等核心流程，更贴合业务需求。"],[6954,"**使用率指示器**：通过进度条直观显示节点的存储使用率"],[5221,"**依赖环境**"],[3778,"**元数据**：Client 向 Master 请求文件元数据与 **块位置**（哪些 Worker 持有哪些块 ID、偏移、长度）。Master 返回 `FileBlocks`（文件状态 + 块位置列表）。"],[3832,"**元数据镜像同步**：Curvine 中的所有元数据修改（创建、删除、修改属性），都会在本地完成后，后台异步同步一份到 UFS，确保 Curvine 与 UFS 的目录结构、文件属性完全一致，实现统一命名空间。"],[6622,"**关于 `--provider`**：同一种 URI scheme 可能映射到不同实现。例如 `oss://...` 既可能走 OSS-HDFS / JindoSDK，也可能走 OpenDAL，因此可以通过 `--provider` 强制指定实现。"],[3974,"**关闭时清理**：在 `SpdkBdev::drop` 中通过 `curvine_spdk_dma_free` 释放缓冲区。如果 drop 截止时间前 inflight I/O 未清空，则将缓冲区指针置空，避免 use-after-free（以安全泄漏换取正确性）。"],[5615,"**兼容 HDFS 生态**：提供 Hadoop FileSystem 与 SDK 接入路径"],[6536,"**兼容包装器 `dfs`**：发行包自带的兼容入口，`fs` / `report` 走 Java `CurvineShell`，保留 Hadoop `FsShell` 风格。"],[3812,"**内存目录树**：聚焦高频操作的极致速度，仅存储目录最核心的结构信息（文件夹名称、父文件夹ID、子节点列表），不存储文件的详细属性（如大小、修改时间）。这样设计既能将内存占用控制在极低水平，又能让列目录、找文件路径等高频操作在内存中直接完成，响应速度极快。"],[5618,"**内建可观测性**：暴露监控与指标，便于集群运维"],[7151,"**内核参数优化**：调整网络缓冲区、资源限制等参数"],[6949,"**最后心跳时间**：显示节点最后一次与Master通信的时间"],[3783,"**写数据**：Client 通过块写 RPC 将数据发往指定 Worker。Worker 将数据持久化到 BlockStore。"],[3784,"**写类型**（UFS 挂载路径见 数据编排 — 挂载模式）："],[3775,"**写路径**：Worker 的写处理逻辑接收块写 RPC，将数据写入 BlockStore，并按请求完成或中止块。"],[5870,"**凭据存储路径：**"],[4001,"**分配器改进**：在高负载下提升性能，减少碎片、锁竞争和时间复杂度。"],[3782,"**分配块**：Client 向 Master 申请新块。Master 选择 Worker（及副本），将块分配记入日志（如 `AddBlock`、`CompleteFile`），并返回块位置给 Client。"],[3814,"**协同逻辑**：采用“按需加载、分工响应”的方式。例如，当用户列某个目录的内容时，内存目录树先快速返回该目录下所有文件/文件夹的名称，确保响应速度；当用户需要查看某个文件的详细信息（如大小、修改时间）时，系统再去 RocksDB 中批量查询对应的详细信息，一次性返回，既保证了速度，又不浪费内存资源。"],[6832,"**协议版本**是用于约束组件之间线上兼容性的单调递增整数，**不等同于**发布版本。"],[6535,"**原生 Rust CLI `cv`**：推荐入口，功能最完整，命令树来自 `curvine-cli`。"],[3864,"**可扩展性**：轻松添加新的存储后端支持"],[6924,"**可用存储空间**：显示剩余可用的存储空间"],[6944,"**可用容量显示**：显示当前可用的存储容量"],[3865,"**可靠性**：内置重试机制和错误处理"],[6918,"**启动时间**：显示集群的启动时间戳"],[3765,"**回放**：`JournalLoader` 将每条已提交的 `JournalEntry` 应用到本地 `FsDir`（如 `mkdir`、`create_file`、`add_block`、`complete_file`、`rename`、`delete`、`mount`、`unmount`），使备节点状态与 Leader 一致。"],[3935,"**固定大小字节缓冲区**：SPDK C 结构体（异步上下文、namespace 数据等）用带有 `#[repr(C, align(8))]` 的 `[u8; N]` 表示，而不是逐字段复刻 C 布局。这样可以避免不同 SPDK 版本之间的结构体布局差异。"],[3976,"**块对齐**：所有 offset 都会向下对齐到设备 block size。这是 NVMe 规范要求，未对齐 DMA 地址会导致 controller 错误。"],[5611,"**多云底层存储支持**：可对接 S3 兼容系统、HDFS、OSS、MinIO 等 UFS 后端，并提供统一访问层"],[5626,"**多云数据缓存，提高跨云、跨区域数据访问效率**"],[5600,"**多副本机制**：多副本机制，保证数据的冗余备份，提高系统的可靠性和容错能力。"],[3862,"**多存储支持**：支持对象存储、文件系统、数据库等多种存储类型"],[5613,"**多级缓存**：支持内存、SSD、HDD 多层缓存策略"],[4464,"**如果你是 Reviewer**，运行："],[4466,"**如果你是作者，需要回应 Review 意见**，运行："],[3767,"**存储**：元数据日志与 Raft 状态使用 **RocksDB**（`RocksLogStorage`）。Journal 作为应用负载承载在 Raft 日志条目中。"],[5625,"**存储大数据计算过程中间结果（shuffle），实现计算、存储的完全分离。**"],[5339,"**客户端库**：提供多语言API，通过RPC与Master节和Worker节点通信"],[6925,"**容量利用率**：通过进度条和百分比显示存储使用率"],[6945,"**容量统计**：实时更新的容量使用情况"],[6932,"**导航按钮**：提供\"Navigate\"按钮用于路径跳转"],[6923,"**已用存储空间**：显示当前已使用的存储空间"],[3834,"**幂等重试保障**：同步操作采用幂等设计，同一个修改操作重复执行，结果也不会发生变化，避免出现重复创建文件、重复删除等异常，确保同步过程的可靠性。"],[3827,"**延迟过高**：外部数据库需要通过网络通信完成读写，每次元数据操作都要多走一次网络，尾延迟会显著升高，远不如“内存+本地 RocksDB”的本地操作速度快，无法满足高频小操作的低延迟需求。"],[5595,"**异步IO**：异步IO设计，充分利用了系统资源，避免了阻塞等待，提高了系统的并发处理能力。"],[3822,"**微小代价**：极短的一致性窗口。如果 Leader 节点刚完成本地修改，还未同步日志就发生故障，这部分未同步的修改可能无法同步到其他节点，但这个窗口极短（通常仅几毫秒），实际生产中出现的概率极低，是性能与一致性之间可接受的权衡。"],[3766,"**快照**：支持 Raft 快照；存在快照时可从快照恢复元数据，无需从头回放。"],[3818,"**快照加速恢复**：如果某台机器因故障、断网等原因，落后 Leader 节点过多日志，无需逐一条回放所有历史日志，Leader 会直接发送当前数据的完整快照，该机器加载快照后就能快速追上集群进度，大幅缩短故障恢复时间，提升系统可用性。"],[5601,"**快照机制**：轻量级快照机制，定期备份数据，提高系统的恢复速度和稳定性。"],[6981,"**性能调优参考**：根据当前配置评估性能优化空间"],[6922,"**总存储容量**：显示集群的总存储容量"],[6943,"**总容量显示**：显示所有工作节点的总存储容量"],[6926,"**总文件数量**：显示文件系统中的文件总数"],[4484,"**改动由你负责。** Skill 只是助手。每个 diff 都要自己看，测试要自己跑，并且能够解释这次改动。提交记录上是你的名字。"],[6956,"**故障检测**：帮助管理员快速识别有问题的节点"],[6982,"**故障诊断支持**：在出现问题时快速检查相关配置"],[3769,"**故障转移**：Leader 宕机后，Raft 选举新 Leader；新 Leader 继续应用日志并对外提供元数据服务。通过日志回放或快照追齐的备节点可参与选举。"],[5599,"**故障转移机制**：故障自动转移，当主节点故障时，自动切换到备用节点，保证系统的高可用性。"],[3779,"**数据**：Client 通过块读 RPC 从对应 Worker 读取块数据。可配置 **并行读** 与 **读前向**（chunk 大小、slice 大小、读前向长度）。"],[6928,"**数据块统计**：显示唯一数据块和副本数据块的数量"],[3833,"**数据异步拷贝**：文件的实际数据块，会在后台异步从 Curvine 拷贝到 UFS，拷贝过程不影响本地元数据的读写操作，避免拖慢写入速度；若 UFS 暂时不可用，拷贝任务会自动重试，直到同步成功。"],[6934,"**文件列表视图**：以列表形式展示当前目录下的文件和子目录"],[6937,"**文件操作**：支持文件的查看、下载、删除等基本操作"],[6935,"**文件详细信息**：显示文件大小、修改时间、权限等属性信息"],[5116,"**方式 A — 在容器内编译，输出到本地 `build/dist`：**"],[5118,"**方式 B — 常驻开发容器：**"],[3762,"**日志**：每次元数据变更都会落盘为 **journal 条目**（如 `Mkdir`、`CreateFile`、`AddBlock`、`CompleteFile`、`Rename`、`Delete`、`Mount`、`UnMount`）。Leader 将条目追加到 Raft 日志；提交后在内存目录树（`FsDir`）上应用。"],[3816,"**日志同步优先**：任何元数据修改操作（创建、删除、重命名、修改属性等），都会先被封装为一条操作日志，存入专门的日志数据库，然后同步到集群中超过半数的机器上。只有多数机器都成功接收并存储这条日志，本次修改操作才算正式生效，确保数据不会因单台机器故障而丢失。"],[3817,"**日志回放保一致**：集群中的 Leader 节点负责发起修改操作、记录日志，Follower 节点（从节点）会实时同步 Leader 的日志，然后按照日志的顺序，逐一条执行相同的修改操作，确保所有节点的元数据状态完全一致，避免出现数据偏差。"],[3828,"**易出现性能瓶颈**：元数据操作多为高频小请求，海量客户端同时连接外部数据库时，很容易打满数据库连接数，导致 QPS 触顶，无法支撑高并发场景。"],[5108,"**构建**：`make build` / `make all` — 编译（输出在 `build/dist`）；`make dist` — 编译并打 tar.gz 到项目根目录；`make dist-only` — 仅对已有 `build/dist` 打包"],[4459,"**标题：** `<type>(<module>): <description> (#<issueNumber>)`"],[3821,"**核心优势**：写入速度大幅提升。无需等待日志同步到多数机器再完成本地修改，本地写入延迟可降低至几毫秒，高并发场景下（如大量小文件创建），吞吐量能提升数倍，完美适配高频小操作场景。"],[3820,"**核心流程**：Leader 节点先更新自身的内存目录树 → 写入本地 RocksDB 完成本地数据修改 → 再将本次修改的日志同步给集群中的其他 Follower 节点，完成一致性同步。"],[4460,"**正文：** Summary、Issue Describe / Design、Changes、Test verified、Dependencies"],[3891,"**注意**：请确保所有 Worker 节点都配置了正确的 Java 和 Hadoop 环境变量，否则 HDFS 挂载和加载操作将会失败。"],[6919,"**活跃工作节点数量**：实时显示当前在线的Worker节点数量"],[6917,"**版本信息**：显示当前运行的Curvine版本号"],[5107,"**环境**：`make check-env` — 检查构建依赖"],[6696,"**用法：** `cv admin config <set|get|reset> ...`"],[6689,"**用法：** `cv bench [OPTIONS]`、`cv bench prefill [OPTIONS]`"],[6661,"**用法：** `cv cancel-load [OPTIONS] <JOB_ID>`"],[6648,"**用法：** `cv export [OPTIONS] <PATH>`"],[6570,"**用法：** `cv fs [OPTIONS] <COMMAND> [ARGS]`"],[6691,"**用法：** `cv fsck <PATH> [OPTIONS]`"],[6637,"**用法：** `cv load [OPTIONS] <SOURCE_PATH> [TARGET_PATH]`"],[6665,"**用法：** `cv load-list [OPTIONS]`"],[6654,"**用法：** `cv load-status [OPTIONS] <JOB_ID>`"],[6558,"**用法：** `cv node [OPTIONS] [-- <NODES>...]`"],[6549,"**用法：** `cv report [json|all|capacity|used|available]`"],[6635,"**用法：** `cv umount <CURVINE_PATH>`"],[6685,"**用法：** `cv version`"],[6936,"**目录操作**：支持创建新目录、删除目录等操作"],[6927,"**目录数量**：显示文件系统中的目录总数"],[6938,"**目录项统计**：显示当前目录下的文件和子目录数量"],[4485,"**确认之前先看一眼。** 草稿的存在是有原因的。Issue、PR 正文或 Review 评论，确认前都值得检查一遍。"],[5112,"**示例**：`make build ARGS='-p core'`、`make build ARGS='-p server -p client'`、`make build ARGS='-p web'`、`RELEASE_VERSION=v1.0.0 make dist`"],[6920,"**离线工作节点数量**：显示当前离线或故障的Worker节点数量"],[6955,"**离线节点列表**：显示当前离线或无响应的工作节点"],[5740,"**系统支持**：支持 FUSE2 与 FUSE3，不同发行版行为可能略有差异。详见 支持的 Linux 发行版。"],[6545,"**约定：**"],[5592,"**纯Rust实现**：Curvine 采用纯 Rust 语言实现，避免了传统语言的性能瓶颈和资源消耗，同时也保证了代码的安全性和稳定性。"],[7150,"**线程数调优**：根据CPU核心数和业务负载调整工作线程数"],[3763,"**组件**：`MasterHandler` 处理 RPC；`MasterFilesystem` 与 `FsDir` 维护目录/文件与块映射；`JournalWriter` 写日志；`WorkerManager` 管理 Worker 与块分布；`MountManager` 管理 UFS 挂载点。"],[3861,"**统一接口**：跨不同存储后端的一致 API"],[3780,"**缓存命中**：若路径为 Curvine 原生文件（非 UFS 挂载），数据按上述方式从 Worker 读取。若路径在 **UFS 挂载** 下，则 统一文件系统 与 缓存行为 生效：在缓存有效时从 Curvine 返回，未命中时从 UFS 读取（可配置 TTL 下的自动缓存）。"],[3764,"**职责**：Raft Follower **不**处理元数据写 RPC。它们接收 Leader 已提交的日志条目并 **回放**，以保持元数据副本一致。"],[3761,"**职责**：Raft Leader 是唯一接受元数据变更 RPC 的节点（创建文件、添加块、重命名、删除、挂载/卸载等）。"],[3869,"**腾讯云 COS**：腾讯云对象存储，支持 `cos://` 协议"],[6947,"**节点ID**：唯一标识工作节点的ID号"],[6950,"**节点容量信息**："],[6957,"**节点恢复状态**：跟踪离线节点的恢复情况"],[6921,"**节点状态指示器**：通过颜色编码直观显示节点健康状态"],[3768,"**角色**：`MasterMonitor` 暴露当前节点是否为主：仅当 Raft 角色为 **Leader** 时 `is_active()` 为 true。客户端或上层应将元数据写请求路由到当前 Leade