ead that holds the SPDK reactor context. `SpdkPoller` bridges the async handler threads (which issue I/O) to the synchronous SPDK polling loop."],[3920,"SPDK 原生可以在单核上达到超过 1000 万 IOPS[1]。Curvine 的 SPDK 路径面向内核 VFS 开销成为瓶颈的工作负载。当你需要比 LocalFile 更低的延迟或更高的吞吐时，就适合启用 SPDK。"],[3938,"SPDK 要求所有 NVMe 命令提交和完成处理都在持有 SPDK reactor 上下文的同一个线程上执行。`SpdkPoller` 用来连接发起 I/O 的异步 handler 线程和同步的 SPDK 轮询循环。"],[3892,"SPDK 集成架构"],[3918,"SPDK（Storage Performance Development Kit）让 Curvine 能够绕过内核，在用户态执行 NVMe I/O。Worker 不再通过内核 VFS（`pread`/`pwrite`）读写数据，而是通过 TCP 或 RDMA 直接访问 NVMe-oF target，并配合专用 poller 线程和基于 hugepage 的 DMA 缓冲区，将延迟降到最低。"],[314,"SpdkBdev (Block Device Handle)"],[3902,"SpdkBdev（块设备句柄）"],[309,"SpdkEnv (Global Environment)"],[3897,"SpdkEnv（全局环境）"],[310,"SpdkEnvState"],[3898,"SpdkEnvState"],[317,"SpdkIoChannel"],[3905,"SpdkIoChannel"],[320,"SpdkMetaStore"],[3908,"SpdkMetaStore"],[312,"SpdkPoller (Dedicated I/O Thread)"],[3900,"SpdkPoller（专用 I/O 线程）"],[1782,"SQLite Single-Replica Manifest"],[5377,"SQLite 单副本清单"],[4967,"SQLite 模式下，Transfer Deployment 使用 `Recreate`，使旧 Pod 在新 Pod 启动前释放 `ReadWriteOnce` 卷。Helm 卸载时会保留 SQLite PVC；只有明确丢弃 Transfer 元数据时才手动删除它。"],[1573,"SSD disk: 1 unit"],[5159,"SSD磁盘 1个"],[2227,"Standalone deployment that can be scaled behind a load balancer"],[1693,"Standalone Mode"],[2496,"Standalone mount mode (`node.mountMode=standalone`)"],[6092,"Standalone 挂载模式（`node.mountMode=standalone`）"],[2164,"Standard file read/write and directory operations"],[160,"Standby Master (Follower)"],[3748,"Standby Master（备 Master）"],[1707,"Start `curvine-fuse`."],[1704,"Start `curvine-master`."],[1706,"Start `curvine-transfer` when `[transfer].enabled = true`."],[1705,"Start `curvine-worker`."],[750,"Start a local cluster from the built distribution"],[1827,"Start a single-node cluster"],[1767,"Start and Stop"],[1906,"Start from a Release Package"],[59,"Start from:"],[71,"Start from:"],[2136,"Start FUSE"],[1694,"Start the Local Cluster"],[1772,"Start with the cluster configuration that already c